Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:12.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is how intelligence is made.\N这就是智能的诞生方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:15.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,A new kind of factory.\N一种新型工厂。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:17.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Generator of tokens.\N词元的生成器。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.88,0:00:24.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The building blocks of AI.\NAI 的积木。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.72,0:00:27.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tokens have opened a new frontier.\N词元开启了新的疆域。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.76,0:00:36.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Turning data into knowledge, reason, action.\N将数据转化为知识、推理与行动。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:39.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,They reveal patterns in complexity.\N揭示复杂性中的模式。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.44,0:00:47.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,We could never see.\N我们此前无法看见。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:49.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mirror our cities.\N模拟我们的城市。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:57.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,To keep us safe.\N为了保障我们的安全。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:00:59.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And lift us high.\N并将我们托举至高处。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:05.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Above them.\N在它们之上。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.24,0:01:12.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tokens help robots learn from us.\N词元帮助机器人向我们学习。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.80,0:01:22.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Work alongside us.\N与我们并肩工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.28,0:01:30.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,They go where we cannot.\N前往我们无法到达的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.36,0:01:35.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lending us helping hands.\N为我们提供帮助之手。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.68,0:01:39.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And closing the gap between hope and healing.\N缩短希望与治愈之间的差距。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:45.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that we breathe easier.\N让我们呼吸更轻松。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:46.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the smallest\N以及最微小的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.77,0:01:47.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,hearts\N心脏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:52.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,beat\N跳动得
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.01,0:02:04.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,stronger.\N更有力。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.40,0:02:09.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tokens are helping us break new\N词元正帮助我们开拓全新的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.01,0:02:13.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,ground on a\N领域。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.85,0:02:16.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,scale\N扩展
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.99,0:02:25.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,never attempted.\N从未尝试过。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:28.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,So we can reach Starcloud\N所以我们可以抵达星云
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:30.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,1 separation confirmed.\N1号分离已确认。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:40.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,to infinity and beyond.\N向无穷远，超越极限。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.40,0:02:40.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Together,\N一起，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.97,0:02:44.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,we take the next great leap into\N我们迈出迈向
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.78,0:02:49.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,a bright new future\N光明崭新未来的下一步
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.68,0:02:58.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,built for all mankind.\N为全人类而建。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.92,0:03:01.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And here in Taipei\N在这里，台北
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.00,0:03:06.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,is where\N就是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.77,0:03:14.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,it all begins.\N一切开始的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:15.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the stage,\N欢迎登上舞台，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.01,0:03:17.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA founder and\N英伟达创始人兼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.12,0:03:19.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,CEO\N首席执行官
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:29.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jensen Huang.\N黄仁勋。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.16,0:03:35.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Welcome to GTC Taiwan.\N欢迎参加 GTC 台北站。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:38.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So great to see all of you.\N很高兴见到大家。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:39.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Very good to be home.\N回到家乡真好。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.90,0:03:41.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I brought my parents home.\N我把父母带回来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:42.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where are my parents?\N我的父母在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.40,0:03:52.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everybody give round of applause to my mom and dad.\N让我们用热烈的掌声欢迎我的妈妈和爸爸。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.08,0:04:00.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,And a round of applause for our pre-game show superstars,\N再来一轮掌声送给我们的赛前表演明星们，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.49,0:04:04.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,ladies and gentlemen.\N各位女士先生们。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.92,0:04:08.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look how adorable they are.\N看他们多可爱啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.52,0:04:10.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The superstars of Taiwan.\N台湾的超级明星。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.00,0:04:12.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh there are so many of you here today.\N哎，今天到场的你们真多。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:21.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are broadcasting this right now to 70 other watch parties across Taiwan.\N我们正在实时向台湾各地的70个观看派对直播。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:24.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,70 different conferences are going at the same time.\N同时有70场不同的会议在进行。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.70,0:04:26.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everybody is watching this keynote.\N每个人都在观看这场主题演讲。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.99,0:04:31.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have so much to tell you, and I have so many partners to thank.\N我们有太多事情要告诉你们，也还有太多合作伙伴要感谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.44,0:04:36.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is incredible how large our ecosystem in Taiwan has become.\N我们的台湾生态系统变得如此庞大，实在令人难以置信。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.76,0:04:41.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Most of the time, when people think about ecosystem, they think about our software stack.\N大多数人提到生态系统时，想到的都是我们的软件栈。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.92,0:04:47.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,They think about the developer ecosystem above the computing systems that NVIDIA builds.\N他们想到的是在英伟达构建的计算系统之上的开发者生态。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.04,0:04:56.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,But NVIDIA's ecosystem spans all the way upstream to all of our supply chain here in Taiwan,\N但英伟达的生态系统不仅覆盖了上游所有在台湾的供应链，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.09,0:05:03.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,where it all begins, and downstream all the way to data centers and eventually to end users.\N那里是所有一切的起点，也延伸到下游，直达数据中心，最终到达终端用户。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.40,0:05:07.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, we're going to talk about almost all of the ecosystem.\N今天，我们将讨论整个生态系统中的几乎所有内容。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.06,0:05:09.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's so many people to thank.\N有太多人需要感谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.28,0:05:12.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I love my ecosystem here.\N我非常喜欢这里的生态系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.20,0:05:14.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, there's so many companies here,\N毕竟这里有这么多公司，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.64,0:05:16.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,and some of my favorite ecosystem\N还有一些我最喜爱的生态系统
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.40,0:05:51.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,partners\N合作伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.16,0:05:53.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,So many\N数不胜数。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.28,0:05:56.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Taiwan's rich ecosystem.\N台湾丰富的生态系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.80,0:06:01.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,The richest ecosystem, the world's best supply chain ecosystem.\N最丰富的生态系统，全球最佳的供应链生态系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.78,0:06:02.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.\N难以置信。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:04.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you all for being here.\N好，感谢大家的到来。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.96,0:06:10.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh this year this year our businesses together are growing incredibly.\N而且今年，我们的业务共同实现了惊人的增长。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.33,0:06:10.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact,\N事实上，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.00,0:06:14.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,somebody told me last night that the annual\N昨晚有人告诉我，台湾的年度
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.90,0:06:25.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,GDP of Taiwan is going to grow almost 10%.\NGDP 将增长近 10%。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.00,0:06:26.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.\N难以置信。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.03,0:06:29.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, we have a lot to talk about.\N好吧，我们有很多话题可以聊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.60,0:06:30.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's get going.\N那我们开始吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.84,0:06:39.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Two years ago when I was here, I started to talk to you about how AI has moved from generative AI and the other waves of AIs that are coming.\N两年前我在这里时，开始和你们谈论人工智能已经从生成式 AI 走向了其他正在到来的人工智能浪潮。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.32,0:06:42.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,The next wave of AI was agentic AI.\N下一波人工智能是代理式人工智能。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.76,0:06:49.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And today we can say that agentic AI has arrived, that useful AI has arrived.\N而今天我们可以宣布，代理式人工智能已经到来，实用的人工智能已经到来。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.64,0:06:51.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, what does this mean?\N这意味着什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:52.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is GitHub.\N这是 GitHub。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.57,0:06:58.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is of course one of the first applications of agentic AI is software coding.\N当然，代理式人工智能最早的几个应用之一就是软件编程。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.64,0:07:01.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,One of the most valuable professions.\N最有价值的职业之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.44,0:07:03.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Incredibly large ecosystem.\N非常庞大的生态系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.65,0:07:07.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,30 million, 40 million professional software developers.\N三千万到四千万名专业的软件开发者。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.00,0:07:14.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Probably another couple of hundred who are students and enthusiasts and so on and so forth.\N可能还有另外几百万名学生、爱好者等。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:20.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,But say 30, 40 million software developers in the world code for a living.\N但全世界大约有三千万到四百万名软件开发者靠编写代码谋生。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.76,0:07:23.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this represents most of them.\N这代表了其中的大多数。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.34,0:07:24.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is GitHub.\N这就是 GitHub。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.45,0:07:31.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,The pull request is when they download software, they modify it, and commit is when they push it back up.\N拉取请求是指他们下载软件，修改后，提交就是将修改后的代码推回。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.04,0:07:32.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?\N明白了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.48,0:07:42.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so if you could look at this in 20 23 the number of commits was 300 million.\N所以如果你看 2023 年的数据，提交次数达到三亿次。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.72,0:07:47.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,2024 400 million.\N2024 年达到四亿次。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.12,0:07:51.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,2025 500 million commits.\N2025 年将达到五亿次提交。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.96,0:07:59.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the first few months in the first few months of 2026, it has nearly tripled.\N2026 年的前几个月，其规模几乎翻了三倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:02.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, what does that mean?\N那意味着什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.80,0:08:12.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,30 million software developers representing about 3 trillion dollars worth of GDP producing three That's what they're paid.\N3000 万软件开发者，代表约 3 万亿美元的 GDP，这就是他们所获得的收入。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.99,0:08:22.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,3 trillion dollars worth of salaries per year, which is generating economic growth for the rest of the industries.\N每年 3 万亿美元的薪资，正在为其他行业创造经济增长。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:31.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Say 100 trillion dollars of the world's industries is impacted is generated by 3 billion dollars worth of salary.\N世界产业中 100 万亿美元的产出，是由 30 亿美元的薪资所驱动的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:33.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,That 3 trillion dollars Excuse me, 3 trillion.\N那 3 万亿美元——抱歉，是 3 万亿美元。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.72,0:08:42.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,That 3 trillion dollars worth of salary is now producing nearly three times as much output.\N那 3 万亿美元的薪资现在正产生近三倍的产出。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.64,0:08:51.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's effectively a 9 trillion dollar productivity from 3 trillion dollars of salaries.\N这相当于用 3 万亿美元的薪资，实现了 9 万亿美元的生产力。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.32,0:08:53.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Does that make any sense?\N这有道理吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.12,0:08:55.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,The difference is absolutely extraordinary.\N这种差异极其惊人。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.65,0:08:56.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the potential.\N这就是潜力所在。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.76,0:08:58.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the promise of AI.\N这就是 AI 的承诺。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.76,0:09:01.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,The number of engineers, software engineers, is actually increasing.\N工程师，尤其是软件工程师的数量实际上正在增加。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.96,0:09:04.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,People talk about AI reducing jobs.\N人们谈论人工智能会减少工作岗位。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.00,0:09:06.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Complete nonsense.\N完全荒谬。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.56,0:09:12.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's causing more software engineers to be hired and the reason for that is very simple.\N这导致了更多软件工程师被雇佣，原因非常简单。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.32,0:09:19.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you can hire a software engineer and you could generate 9 trillion dollars worth of productive work,\N如果你能雇佣一名软件工程师，就能创造出价值9万亿美元的生产性工作，
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.67,0:09:23.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,why wouldn't you want to hire more software engineers?\N那你为什么不希望雇佣更多软件工程师呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.72,0:09:29.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,If that line was flat then obviously people will hire fewer software engineers.\N如果这条曲线是平的，显然人们会雇佣更少的软件工程师。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.98,0:09:34.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,But because the output is so incredible, people want to hire more software engineers.\N但因为产出如此惊人，人们更想雇佣更多的软件工程师。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.31,0:09:37.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is going to show up in our economy somehow soon.\N这种趋势很快就会在我们的经济中显现出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.96,0:09:40.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the first thing is useful AI has arrived.\N所以，首先就是实用型人工智能已经到来。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.95,0:09:44.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, what does that mean from the industry's perspective?\N从产业角度来看，这意味着什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:50.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,From the industry's perspective, that means that tokens are now in extraordinary demand.\N从产业角度来看，这意味着词元现在处于前所未有的高需求状态。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.19,0:09:53.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because if you could do this, you're going to want to produce more of it.\N因为你一旦能做到这一点，就会想要生产更多。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:57.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And because tokens are now profitable units.\N而且因为词元现在是盈利单位。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:10:02.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tokens are now prof- profitable units of revenues.\N词元现在是收入的盈利单位。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.12,0:10:08.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because it is now profitable, the AI companies want to build a lot more tokens, generate a lot more tokens,\N因为现在盈利，AI公司想要制造更多的词元，生成更多的词元，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:16.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,build more AI factories, which is the reason why compute demand here in Taiwan has skyrocketed.\N建造更多的AI工厂，这正是台湾这里计算需求急剧飙升的原因。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.48,0:10:22.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is precisely the reason why all of you are so busy and your businesses are doing so well.\N这也正是你们所有人如此忙碌、生意如此红火的原因。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.84,0:10:34.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, that looks like some of your stock price.\N事实上，这看起来有点像你们的股价。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.08,0:10:36.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The compute pattern has changed.\N计算模式已经改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.64,0:10:38.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything has changed.\N一切都变了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.70,0:10:42.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, the first idea is that useful AI has arrived.\N所以，第一个想法是，有用的AI已经到来。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.52,0:10:45.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI is now a profit generator.\NAI现在是利润生成器。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.20,0:10:48.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI is now a GDP generator.\NAI现在是GDP生成器。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.23,0:10:52.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And behind it is a whole new kind of computing pattern.\N背后是一种全新的计算模式。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.28,0:10:55.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not just a large language model, but an agent.\N不仅是大型语言模型，更是一个智能体。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.32,0:10:59.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, almost everything we're going to talk about is going to be based on this.\N今天我们将讨论的几乎所有内容，都将基于这一点。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.79,0:11:03.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, let me take a quick moment and show you what I'm talking about.\N所以，让我花一点时间，向你们展示我在说什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.92,0:11:06.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Inside in this is a This is an agent.\N在这里面，这是一个智能体。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.92,0:11:09.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's an agent application.\N这是一个智能体应用。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.72,0:11:13.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the old days, this would be application.\N在过去，这会是一个应用程序。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.68,0:11:15.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,This would be code.\N这会是代码。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.92,0:11:19.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this would be operating system.\N而这会是操作系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.72,0:11:25.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Application, code running inside an application inside an operating system.\N应用程序、运行在应用程序内的代码、以及运行在操作系统内的应用程序。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.12,0:11:26.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, it is agent,\N如今，它是智能体，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.43,0:11:33.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,which consists of a large language model or many sitting inside a\N由一个大型语言模型或多个模型组成，运行在内部。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.33,0:11:39.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,harness and that harness helps it orchestrates it to do productive work.\N智能体运行框架，而这个运行框架帮助它协调各项任务，完成高效工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.88,0:11:41.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the input.\N这是输入。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.52,0:11:50.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,When that input comes, it has to understand, observe, reason, act, use tools, use tools.\N当输入到来时，它必须理解、观察、推理、行动，并使用工具，使用工具。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.18,0:11:58.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,That tool could be a spreadsheet, web browser, a data processing engine, database engine, for example.\N这个工具可以是电子表格、网页浏览器、数据处理引擎或数据库引擎等。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.16,0:12:09.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is orchestrated this harness orchestrate this routing of information every single time it touches either processing the context,\N这个运行框架会协调信息的流转，每次处理上下文时都如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.84,0:12:18.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,understanding what is happening, reasoning about what to do, coming up with a plan that you can act that it acts on.\N理解当前情况，推理该采取什么行动，制定出可执行的计划，然后付诸行动。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:23.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,That orchestration path is orchestrated by some software.\N这个协调路径由某种软件实现。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.60,0:12:26.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so this is fundamentally a agent.\N因此，这本质上是一个智能体。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.59,0:12:34.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,It deals with short-term memory, called working memory, long-term memory, just like we do, we have long-term memory.\N它处理短期记忆，称为工作记忆，以及长期记忆，就像我们一样，我们也有长期记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.26,0:12:37.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so the memory management system is incredibly important.\N因此，记忆管理系统至关重要。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.01,0:12:42.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,This entire system is called an agent.\N整个系统被称为智能体。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.08,0:12:52.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The large language model is used to do the thinking and the harness connects everything together, just like an operating system.\N大语言模型负责思考，而运行框架则将所有部分连接起来，就像操作系统一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:53.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?\N好的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.28,0:12:57.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so this is the new computing model and this is what an agent.\N这就是新的计算模型，这就是智能体。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:12:59.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,It could do incredible things.\N它能完成令人难以置信的事情。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.19,0:13:01.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the big breakthrough.\N这是重大的突破。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:10.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The simultaneous convert the convergence of large language models that are now able to do a really good job thinking, reasoning, planning,\N同时实现了大型语言模型的融合，这些模型现在能够很好地进行思考、推理和规划，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.85,0:13:20.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,using tools, and the fact that we have now these harnesses that manages memory, the orchestration, uses tools, we can now do amazing things.\N使用工具，而且我们现在已经有了能够管理内存、协调任务、\N调用工具的运行框架，现在我们可以实现令人惊叹的成果。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:22.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me give you some example.\N让我举个例子。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.76,0:13:24.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is This is a prompt.\N这是提示。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.10,0:13:26.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the prompt.\N这是提示。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.44,0:13:32.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the code that is generated and this comes out.\N这是生成的代码，结果就出来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.44,0:13:35.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the input.\N这是输入。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.48,0:13:40.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the input and that's the output.\N这是输入，这就是输出。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.52,0:13:41.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you guys What do you guys think?\N你们觉得怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.50,0:13:47.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's pretty amazing, right?\N实在太惊人了，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.60,0:13:50.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dude, we use cloud code here, but Codex it does an incredible job as well.\N嘿，我们这里用云代码，但 Codex 的表现也相当出色。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.92,0:13:52.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here's another example.\N这是另一个例子。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:54.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the input,\N这是输入，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.10,0:14:03.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,create a GIF NVIDIA green dots on black scatter form Taiwan 101 building morph\N创建一个 GIF，NVIDIA 绿点在黑色背景上从台北 101 大楼形态散开
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.23,0:14:09.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,2 GTC type A 2 2026 morph 2 NVIDIA eye logo then scatter and repeat.\N2 个 GTC 类型 A 2 2026 形态变换 2 次，\NNVIDIA 眼睛标志出现，然后散开并重复。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.60,0:14:09.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right?\N对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.94,0:14:10.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, you saw that.\N所以，你们看到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.81,0:14:11.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,That was the prompt.\N这就是提示。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.98,0:14:13.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here's the next one.\N下一个是这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.40,0:14:15.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,I lost my remote control battery clip.\N我把遥控器电池夹弄丢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.79,0:14:17.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,It looks like this.\N看起来是这样的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.34,0:14:19.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Create a CAD file.\N创建一个 CAD 文件。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.11,0:14:20.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,It uses a tool.\N它使用一个工具。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.46,0:14:26.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Create a CAD file ready for 3D printing to create a new new one.\N创建一个适合 3D 打印的 CAD 文件，以制作一个新的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.12,0:14:27.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Make sense?\N明白了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.56,0:14:30.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is now the new computing pattern.\N现在，这已成为新的计算模式。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:41.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whereas we used to launch an application, click and type, we now replace that with explaining to the AI what we want,\N过去我们启动一个应用程序，点击并输入文字，而现在我们用向 AI 阐述我们的需求来取代这一过程，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.04,0:14:50.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,our intent, and the AI generates the code or uses tools and produce the necessary output.\N说明我们的意图，AI 会生成代码或调用工具，产出所需结果。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.44,0:14:54.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is how computers are going to work in the future.\N这就是未来计算机的工作方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.56,0:14:57.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is agentic AI.\N这就是代理式 AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.08,0:15:00.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,For 2 years we've been building towards this and now it has arrived.\N我们已经为此准备了两年，现在它终于到来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:05.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, one of the big breakthroughs, of course, is tool use.\N现在，一个重大突破当然是工具使用。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.08,0:15:09.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,A lot of people have said, "You know, Jensen, AI's coming, agentic AI's coming,\N很多人说：“你知道吗，黄仁勋，AI来了，代理式AI来了，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.62,0:15:12.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,therefore all of the software companies are going to go out of business."\N所以所有软件公司都将倒闭。”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.96,0:15:22.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I said it's exactly the opposite because there are going to be so many agents, the world is no longer at by the number of people.\N我说恰恰相反，因为将会有如此多的智能体，世界不再由人数决定。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.68,0:15:28.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Therefore, those agents are going to use more tools than ever.\N因此，这些智能体将比以往任何时候都使用更多的工具。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.44,0:15:32.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is actually an incredible time to be a software company.\N这实际上正是软件公司大展身手的绝佳时机。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.28,0:15:38.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the software has to be presented to the agent in a way that the agent can use it.\N但软件必须以智能体能够使用的方式呈现。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.88,0:15:48.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a break big breakthrough and in fact what we have done, as you know, what Nvidia's treasure is is all of our CUDA libraries.\N这是一次巨大的突破，事实上，正如你们所知，英伟达的宝藏就是我们所有的CUDA库。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.05,0:15:49.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,I call them CUDA-X libraries.\N我称它们为CUDA-X库。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.95,0:15:52.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Nvidia's treasure.\N这就是英伟达的宝藏。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.24,0:16:03.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, we're able to now pre- present these CUDA-X libraries to agents who can use it much more effectively than even hu- humans.\N如今，我们终于能够预先将这些CUDA-X库呈现给智能体，它们使用起来比人类还要高效。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.45,0:16:07.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, this is a wonderful time for CUDA-X libraries.\N所以，这对CUDA-X库来说是绝佳的时机。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.86,0:16:10.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.\N我们来看一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.00,0:16:16.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,20 years ago, we built CUDA, a single architecture for accelerated computing.\N20年前，我们开发了CUDA，一种用于加速计算的单一架构。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.88,0:16:19.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We reinvented computing.\N我们重新定义了计算。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.20,0:16:26.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,A thousand CUDA-X libraries help developers make breakthroughs in every field of science and engineering.\N一千个CUDA-X库帮助开发者在科学与工程的各个领域实现突破。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.36,0:16:33.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,CUDA-X libraries are tools for agents. cuLitho for computational\NCUDA-X库是智能体的工具，cuLitho用于计算光刻。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.36,0:16:43.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,lithography. cuOpt for decision optimization. cuDSS for direct sparse solvers.\NcuOpt用于决策优化。cuDSS用于直接稀疏求解。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.72,0:16:49.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,AIQ for deep research across structured and unstructured documents.\NAIQ用于在结构化与非结构化文档中的深度研究。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:53.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Aerial for AI-RAN.\NAerial用于AI-RAN。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.76,0:16:57.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Warp for differentiable physics.\NWarp用于可微分物理。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.52,0:17:00.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Parabricks for genomics.\NParabricks用于基因组学。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.36,0:17:02.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,At their foundation are\N它们的基础是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.31,0:17:03.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,algorithms and\N算法和
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.77,0:17:04.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,they\N它们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.48,0:17:50.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,are\N是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.82,0:19:58.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,beautiful.\N美丽的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.24,0:20:01.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,A round of applause for math.\N为数学鼓掌。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.28,0:20:08.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Math is beautiful.\N数学很美。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.24,0:20:12.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,The computing pattern the computing pattern of software is going to change.\N软件的计算模式将发生变化。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.80,0:20:15.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, let's come back to this.\N事实上，我们回头再看这一点。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.24,0:20:17.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the agent.\N这就是智能体。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.06,0:20:25.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is the ultimate disaggregated and distributed computing computing model.\N它是终极的去中心化和分布式计算模型。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.64,0:20:31.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,So many different computers are going to be activated in order to process this agent.\N为了处理这个智能体，将激活许多不同的计算机。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:36.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,The agent consists of model, harness,\N智能体由模型、运行框架、
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.96,0:20:43.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,tools and skills, and a runtime.\N工具和技能，以及运行时组成。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.16,0:20:48.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of that is running at different places in a data center.\N所有这些都在数据中心的不同位置运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.20,0:20:52.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can think of the model as the brain.\N你可以把模型看作大脑。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.20,0:20:55.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,The harness as the body.\N把运行框架看作身体。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.24,0:21:02.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The tools that it uses working in a runtime, think of it as a workshop.\N它在运行时所使用的工具，可以想象成一个车间。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.60,0:21:08.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this is a person a worker working with tools in a workshop.\N所以这就像一个人在车间里使用工具工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:11.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course, this is being done at extraordinarily large scales.\N当然，这一切都是在极其庞大的规模下进行的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:16.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And each one of those steps are running in a different part of the computer.\N而这些步骤中的每一个，都在计算机的不同部分运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:21.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you could see the large language model is thinking.\N你可以看到大型语言模型正在思考。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.16,0:21:30.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Context processing, observing, understanding the environment, reasoning, coming up with a plan, and acting on the plan.\N上下文处理、观察、理解环境、推理、制定计划并执行计划。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.70,0:21:38.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every single time that happens, an entire rack of Grace Blackwell NVLink 72 is activated.\N每当这种情况发生一次，一整排 Grace Blackwell NVLink 72 就会被激活。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.17,0:21:41.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's thinking with the large language model.\N它正借助大型语言模型进行思考。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.68,0:21:46.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whenever it uses a tool, a CPU use is used.\N每当它使用一个工具时，就会调用一个 CPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.08,0:21:48.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,That tool could be a C compiler.\N这个工具可以是一个 C 编译器。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.91,0:21:50.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,It could be Python.\N可能是 Python。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.28,0:21:51.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,It could be JavaScript.\N可能是 JavaScript。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.97,0:21:55.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or it could be accelerated computing.\N或者可能是加速计算。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.12,0:21:59.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today's agents are relatively simple users of tools.\N当前的智能体对工具的使用相对简单。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.92,0:22:03.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, they're going to be very sophisticated users of tools,\N未来，它们将成为工具的高级使用者，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.40,0:22:09.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,which is the reason why the CUDA-X libraries that I showed you are going to be incredibly popular with agents.\N这正是我向你们展示的 CUDA-X 库将受到智能体极大欢迎的原因。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.76,0:22:13.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,They solve some of the most important problems the world knows.\N它们解决了世界上一些最重要的问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.24,0:22:22.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And all of our CUDA-X libraries are now now going to come with skills that the AI could learn how to use.\N现在，我们所有的 CUDA-X 库都将附带 AI 可学习使用的技能。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.68,0:22:32.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, the CUDA-X library, some skills, basically a manual, the AI reads it and go, "Aha, that's how you use it."\N所以，CUDA-X 库就像一份手册，AI 读完后会说：“啊，原来这么用。”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.24,0:22:36.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,The ability to use these libraries by agents are going to be incredible.\N智能体使用这些库的能力将非常强大。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.63,0:22:42.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the tools run on CPUs and GPUs and large language models.\N因此，这些工具将在 CPU 和 GPU 上运行，同时支持大型语言模型。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.20,0:22:50.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The security harness runs on CPUs and a security processor called a DPU, NVIDIA's BlueField.\N安全运行框架则运行在 CPU 和一种名为 DPU 的安全处理器上，即英伟达的 BlueField。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.60,0:22:53.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The orchestration of all this runs on a CPU.\N所有这些的协调工作都由 CPU 完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.85,0:22:59.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the entire harness, and the CPU's orchestrating all of the work.\N这就是完整的运行框架，CPU 正在协调所有工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.48,0:23:02.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,One of the hardest parts is memory.\N其中最困难的部分是内存。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.07,0:23:12.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,You could just imagine the working memory is called KV caching, what to remember, compaction, not just compression, but how to retrieve.\N你可以想象，工作内存被称为 KV 缓存，即需要记住什么，压缩不仅涉及压缩，还包括如何检索。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.20,0:23:14.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you retrieve structured data?\N你能检索结构化数据吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.05,0:23:16.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you retrieve unstructured data?\N你能检索非结构化数据吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.80,0:23:22.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is the ontology, the relationship of all of these different data to itself?\N所有这些不同数据之间的本体论关系是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.44,0:23:25.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,That entire processing is incredibly complicated.\N整个处理过程极其复杂。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.91,0:23:34.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The memory system the memory system of AIs is going to cause the storage system to be completely revolutionized.\NAI 的内存系统将彻底重塑存储系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.68,0:23:41.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,As you could see, every aspect of this computing model, this computing pattern,\N如你所见，这种计算模型的每个方面，这种计算模式，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.86,0:23:48.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,this new application called an agent, is fundamentally different than the way that applications used to run.\N这种名为智能体的新应用，从根本上不同于以往应用程序的运行方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.88,0:23:54.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,A whole bunch of software sitting inside a binary sitting inside an operating system.\N大量软件运行在一个二进制文件中，而这个二进制文件又运行在操作系统内。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.36,0:23:58.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the reason this disaggregated,\N这正是我们构建下一代 Vera Rubin 的原因。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.16,0:24:09.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,this distributed this heterogeneous computing problem is precisely the reason we built our next generation Vera Rubin.\N这种解耦、分布式、异构计算的问题，正是我们打造下一代 Vera Rubin 的原因。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.92,0:24:12.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin is not one chip.\NVera Rubin 不是一颗芯片。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.72,0:24:15.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin is not a GPU only.\NVera Rubin 不只是 GPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.33,0:24:21.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,It starts with a GPU, but Vera Rubin is incredible.\N它始于 GPU，但 Vera Rubin 非常惊人。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.96,0:24:25.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,This entire thing is Vera Rubin.\N整个系统就是 Vera Rubin。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.00,0:24:27.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,From end to end.\N从头到尾。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.92,0:24:30.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has GPUs.\N它拥有 GPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.12,0:24:32.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin NVLink 72.\NVera Rubin NVLink 72。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.76,0:24:36.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is orchestrated by Vera CPUs that I'm going to tell you more about.\N由我接下来会详细介绍的 Vera CPU 协调。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.63,0:24:40.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,The storage systems revolutionary.\N存储系统革命性。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.18,0:24:45.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera along with CX9, our software stack called DOCA.\NVera 搭配 CX9，以及我们名为 DOCA 的软件栈。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.28,0:24:56.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The security processor that's inside so that everything is encrypted at rest, in motion, as well as in use.\N内置的安全处理器确保所有数据在静止、传输和使用过程中均被加密。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.64,0:25:01.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything across this is secure because the AI model is so precious.\N由于AI模型极为珍贵，因此这一切都得到了安全保障。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.64,0:25:07.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the reason why this entire system obeys confidential computing.\N这正是整个系统遵循保密计算原则的原因。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.56,0:25:12.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each one of these systems would be a complete revolution in itself.\N每一个这样的系统本身都是一场彻底的革命。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.12,0:25:18.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin is the most ambitious endeavor in the history of our company.\N维拉·鲁宾是我们公司历史上最具雄心的项目。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.60,0:25:23.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The whole company worked on Vera Rubin across all 40,000 engineers.\N全公司所有四万名工程师都参与了维拉·鲁宾的开发。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.64,0:25:26.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not to mention all of you.\N更不用说在座的各位了。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.24,0:25:30.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of you participated in the creation of this entire system.\N你们所有人共同参与了这一整个系统的创建。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.48,0:25:36.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin is really a miracle and it's not just one chip, it is so many.\N维拉·鲁宾确实是个奇迹，它不仅仅是一颗芯片，而是众多芯片的集合。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.72,0:25:39.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, it's even beyond that.\N而且远不止于此。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.20,0:25:42.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,A long time ago Nvidia used to be a GPU company.\N很久以前，英伟达还只是一家GPU公司。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.76,0:25:48.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,But over the years we've evolved to become a systems company.\N但多年来，我们已演变为一家系统公司。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.36,0:25:55.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're looking here now for the most complex systems, most complex and ground-up system ever designed.\N你现在看到的是迄今为止设计过的最复杂的系统，也是最复杂、从零开始构建的系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.00,0:26:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,But ultimately, our customers, our partners don't want to buy computers.\N但归根结底，我们的客户和合作伙伴并不想购买计算机。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.96,0:26:10.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,They want to build AI factories, which is the reason why Nvidia has really started to transform ourselves yet again.\N他们想打造 AI 工厂，这正是英伟达再次进行自我转型的根本原因。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.96,0:26:17.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,You could see so much of our technology is now at the entire infrastructure scale.\N你可以看到，我们的许多技术如今已覆盖整个基础设施层面。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.20,0:26:20.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our partners are at infrastructure scale.\N我们的合作伙伴也已扩展到基础设施层面。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.44,0:26:24.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Power generators, cooling systems, the grid providers.\N发电设备、冷却系统、电网供应商。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.00,0:26:34.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,So many industrial companies are now part of our ecosystem because ultimately, we're trying to build an entire stack just like GPUs,\N如此多的工业公司如今已成为我们生态系统的一部分，因为我们最终的目标是打造一个完整的技术栈，\N就像我们当初打造 Grace Blackwell NVLink 72 时那样，也正如现在这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.66,0:26:41.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,just like when we were building Grace Blackwell NVLink 72, just like now,\N就像当年我们打造 Grace Blackwell NVLink 72，就像现在，
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.40,0:26:49.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,we are building a full-stack system so that our customers could build amazing AI infrastructure.\N我们正在构建一个完整的系统，让客户能够打造卓越的 AI 基础设施。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.86,0:26:52.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.\N让我们来看一看。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.08,0:26:58.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,The world is racing to build AI factories, the largest infrastructure build-out in human history.\N世界正在竞相建设 AI 工厂，这是人类历史上规模最大的基础设施建设。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.52,0:27:04.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI factories are incredibly complex, every layer, chip, rack, network, power,\NAI 工厂极其复杂，每一层——芯片、机架、网络、电力——
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.94,0:27:13.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,cooling, grid, must be designed together from end to end because compute is revenues.\N冷却、电网必须从头到尾一体化设计，因为计算就是收入。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.64,0:27:23.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA DSX is the blueprint, a reference design for building and operating AI factories at maximum efficiency and profitability.\N英伟达 DSX 是蓝图，是构建和运营 AI 工厂以实现最高效率和盈利的参考设计。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.40,0:27:25.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,It starts with DSX Sim.\N它始于 DSX Sim。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.80,0:27:34.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,With the DSX Sim Omniverse blueprint, partners design and validate an NVIDIA Vera Rubin AI factory before a single rack lands.\N通过 DSX Sim 的 Omniverse 蓝图，\N合作伙伴在首个机架落地前即可设计并验证英伟达 Vera Rubin AI 工厂。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.88,0:27:39.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,They plan the layout.\N他们规划布局。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.24,0:27:43.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Simulate the power and cooling.\N模拟供电和冷却。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.44,0:27:44.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Design the network.\N设计网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.65,0:27:46.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Validate every integration.\N验证每一处集成。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.35,0:27:50.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Test every change in the digital twin.\N在数字孪生中测试每一处变更。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.60,0:27:52.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,The factory powers on.\N工厂启动运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.52,0:27:59.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,DSX OS takes over and provisions, operates, monitors, and remediates the infrastructure.\NDSX OS 接管并完成基础设施的配置、运行、监控与修复。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.48,0:28:08.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Turning the installed systems into trusted, multi-tenant, resilient, AI-ready capacity.\N将已安装的系统转变为可信的、多租户的、有韧性的、随时可用的 AI 能力。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.20,0:28:12.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today's AI factories over provision power by up to 40%.\N当前的AI工厂电力配置比实际需求高出多达40%。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.70,0:28:19.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,DSX Max LPS lets operators safely deploy more GPUs inside the same power budget.\NDSX Max LPS让运营商在相同电力预算下安全部署更多GPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.24,0:28:24.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Adding billions in annual revenue.\N带来数十亿美元的年收入。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.64,0:28:30.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Breakthrough hot liquid cooling at 45° C uses less water and energy.\N在45°C下实现突破性高温液冷，用水和能耗更少。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.48,0:28:33.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,More power going to revenue-generating compute.\N更多电力被用于产生收益的计算。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.00,0:28:36.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Incredible.\N非常惊人。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.16,0:28:44.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dynamic power allocation steers power from rack to rack, recovering stranded watts, sending them where work is happening.\N动态电力分配可实现机架间的电力调配，回收闲置电量，将其输送至正在运行工作的位置。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.92,0:28:53.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,In-rack power smoothing flattens peak current spikes and power surges.\N机架内电力平滑技术可消除峰值电流波动和电力浪涌。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.12,0:29:03.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Throughout the factory, teams of AI agents work with DSX Max LPS, continuously coordinating to balance cooling and power to meet workload demand.\N在整个工厂中，AI智能体团队与DSX Max LPS协同工作，\N持续协调以平衡冷却与电力，满足工作负载需求。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.48,0:29:09.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,DSX AI factories are flexible energy assets that operate cooperatively with the grid.\NDSX AI工厂是灵活的能源资产，可与电网协同运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.48,0:29:19.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,DSX Flex reads real-time grid signals and dynamically adjusts factory power when the grid needs relief.\NDSX Flex可读取电网的实时信号，并在电网需要缓解时动态调整工厂的电力使用。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.88,0:29:24.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,A 100 gigawatts of AI factories will come online before the end of the decade.\N到本十年末，将有100吉瓦的AI工厂投入运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.72,0:29:28.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia DSX AI factories run at highest efficiency,\N英伟达 DSX AI 工厂运行效率最高，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.51,0:29:30.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,produce the lowest cost tokens,\N产生的词元成本最低，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.54,0:29:41.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,and make the grid stronger.\N并使电网更加强大。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.60,0:29:45.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've shown you ecosystem slides of the past.\N我向你们展示了过去的生态系统幻灯片。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.76,0:29:53.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where Nvidia's computing layers and software and software and computing stacks are integrated into other people's platforms,\N在这些幻灯片中，英伟达的计算层、软件和计算栈被整合到其他人的平台中，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.56,0:29:57.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,third-party platforms and libraries that serves end markets.\N服务于终端市场的第三方平台和库。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.51,0:30:00.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,That was a computing ecosystem.\N那是一个计算生态系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.60,0:30:03.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is an AI factory ecosystem.\N这是一个 AI 工厂生态系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.44,0:30:06.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is way downstream of all of you.\N这远远超出了你们所有人的范畴。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.56,0:30:12.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Upstream of me is all of you and downstream of us is this ecosystem.\N在我上游的是你们所有人，而在我们下游的是这个生态系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.44,0:30:18.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because Nvidia ultimately is not just building a GPU, not just building a system,\N因为英伟达最终不仅仅是在制造 GPU，也不仅仅是在构建系统，
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.63,0:30:26.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're helping customers build these AI factories, these AI infrastructure that is so immensely complex.\N我们正在帮助客户打造这些极为复杂的 AI 工厂和 AI 基础设施。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.28,0:30:33.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each one of these at 1 gigawatt level started at 30 20 30 billion dollars.\N每个 1 吉瓦级别的项目，起初是 200–300 亿美元。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.66,0:30:42.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is at 50 60 billion dollars and soon it will be 80 100 billion dollars per gigawatt.\N目前成本已达500亿至600亿美元，不久后将升至每吉瓦800亿至1000亿美元。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.44,0:30:46.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,100 billion dollars into an AI factory.\N投入1000亿美元建设AI工厂。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.92,0:30:50.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,It must work the first time and it must work right away.\N它必须一次成功，且必须立即生效。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.44,0:30:52.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cost of capital is incredible.\N资本成本惊人。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.85,0:30:55.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,The complexity is incredible.\N复杂性令人惊叹。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.23,0:31:00.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, as you see, we used to design a chip inside a computer.\N所以，正如你们所见，我们过去是在计算机内部设计芯片。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.64,0:31:04.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then we simulated a system inside a computer.\N然后我们在计算机内部模拟整个系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.92,0:31:11.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, you saw just now, everything was built in Omniverse.\N今天，你们刚刚看到，所有内容都是在Omniverse中构建的。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.36,0:31:14.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've been working with Omniverse with all of you for a long time.\N我已与Omniverse以及各位一起工作了很长时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.64,0:31:16.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,This was the dream come true.\N这正是梦想成真。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.96,0:31:24.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, that we can build these gigantic systems as large as the world wants to build inside a digital framework,\N从而使我们能够在数字框架内，构建出如世界所需般巨大的系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.21,0:31:33.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,inside a digital simulator, in a digital world long before we build the first break ground and put our money to work.\N在一个数字模拟器中，在一个我们尚未动工、尚未投入资金之前就已存在的数字世界里。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.73,0:31:38.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, this is our ecosystem, our we call it DSX.\N所以，这是我们构建的生态系统，我们称之为 DSX。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.16,0:31:39.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,RTX is for our GPU.\NRTX 用于我们的 GPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.99,0:31:42.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,DGX is for our systems.\NDGX 用于我们的系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.23,0:31:45.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now DSX, basically, infrastructure.\N而现在，DSX 基本上就是基础设施。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.48,0:31:51.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because of the work that we do here across this entire stack, including our systems and software,\N正因为我们在此整个技术栈上所做的工作，包括我们的系统和软件，
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.27,0:31:58.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's the reason why we could work with small companies and enable them to be world-class AI clouds.\N才让我们能够与中小企业合作，助力它们成为世界级的 AI 云服务提供商。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.56,0:32:03.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every one of these I'm about to show you are small companies just recently.\N我接下来要展示的这些公司，都是最近才成立的中小企业。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.11,0:32:08.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now CoreWeave is worth 50, 60, 70 billion dollars and growing incredibly fast.\N而如今，CoreWeave 的估值已达 500 亿、600 亿甚至 700 亿美元，且增长极为迅猛。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.91,0:32:11.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Recently, we worked with Nebius.\N最近，我们与 Nebius 合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.52,0:32:14.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And again, they're growing incredibly fast.\N他们同样在飞速增长。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.36,0:32:18.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each one of these clouds have incredible customers.\N这些云服务提供商都拥有极为出色的客户。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.08,0:32:20.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cursor, the software coding company.\NCursor，一家软件编码公司。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.00,0:32:32.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Black Mountain Labs, image generation, World Labs, World Foundation model, Revolut, the leading financial services AI company, and Shopify.\N黑山实验室，图像生成，世界实验室，世界基础模型，Revolut，\N领先的金融服务AI公司，以及Shopify。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.08,0:32:33.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here's another one.\N这里还有另一个。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.05,0:32:38.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's this Enscape, and their customers are British Telecom, Google.\N有这么一个Enscape，他们的客户包括英国电信和谷歌。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.72,0:32:44.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Google is using one of our AI clouds, Thinking Machines, a Frontier Labs company.\N谷歌正在使用我们的一套AI云，Thinking Machines，是一家前沿实验室公司。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.99,0:32:46.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're super exciting.\N我们非常激动。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.32,0:32:48.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here's Naver Cloud in Korea.\N这是位于韩国的Naver Cloud。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.92,0:32:54.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bank of Korea, Hyundai, so many incredible companies.\N韩国银行、现代汽车，还有太多令人惊叹的公司。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.10,0:32:57.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here's one in in India, Yotta.\N这是一家位于印度的公司，Yotta。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.88,0:32:59.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Incredible companies.\N令人惊叹的公司。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.44,0:33:05.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here's one uh based in Singapore, building in Australia, Together AI.\N这是一家总部位于新加坡、在澳大利亚开展建设的公司，Together AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.40,0:33:07.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI Singapore.\N新加坡AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.32,0:33:09.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is one in Indonesia.\N这是印度尼西亚的一家。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.40,0:33:16.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each one of these companies, each one of these companies are serving regional as well as global customers.\N这些公司中的每一家，都在服务区域及全球客户。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.76,0:33:18.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI is going to run everywhere.\NAI 将无处不在。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.97,0:33:21.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every company will be powered by it.\N每家公司都将以其为动力。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.84,0:33:25.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every region will build it.\N每个地区都将建设它。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.60,0:33:27.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Indosat here in in Indonesia.\N印度尼西亚的 Indosat。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.78,0:33:31.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here in Taiwan, GMI.\N台湾这里的 GMI。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.68,0:33:34.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here in Taiwan, GMI.\N台湾这里的 GMI。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.36,0:33:41.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's okay to clap.\N鼓掌没关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.16,0:33:48.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, incredible incredible uh incredible companies, incredible opportunity, but all of them need several things.\N所以，这些公司令人惊叹，机会令人惊叹，但它们都需要一些东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.04,0:33:51.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course, they need the computing stack.\N当然，它们需要计算技术栈。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.20,0:33:55.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This entire stack underneath, this is what made NVIDIA famous.\N这整个底层技术栈，正是让英伟达闻名的原因。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.40,0:33:58.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of our hardware and software and libraries,\N我们所有的硬件、软件和库，
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.66,0:34:08.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,our connection into the world's ecosystem of third-party developers makes it possible for anyone to stand up an AI cloud.\N以及与全球第三方开发者生态系统的连接，使得任何人都能搭建起自己的 AI 云。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.08,0:34:12.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,However, the AI cloud is so complex now.\N然而，如今的 AI 云已经变得极为复杂。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.24,0:34:13.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the software version.\N这是软件层面的版本。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.72,0:34:16.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the computer science version.\N这是计算机科学层面的版本。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.84,0:34:22.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,The money version, the asset version is what I showed you earlier.\N金钱层面和资产层面，就是我之前向你们展示的。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.63,0:34:25.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a giant factory.\N它是一个巨大的工厂。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.24,0:34:32.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Having this ability alone is not enough, which is the reason why NVIDIA has become an AI infrastructure company.\N仅仅拥有这种能力是不够的，这正是英伟达为何成为 AI 基础设施公司的原因。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.68,0:34:44.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, doing this well and becoming incredibly good at at helping customers build AI factories and deploying AI factories is incredibly important.\N现在，要做得出色，并且在帮助客户构建和部署 AI 工厂方面变得极为精通，这一点至关重要。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.38,0:34:46.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is this.\N而原因就在于此。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.52,0:34:49.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Compute is revenue now.\N计算现在就是收入。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.36,0:34:51.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Compute is profit.\N计算现在就是利润。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.44,0:34:55.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,The absence of revenues and profit is loss.\N没有收入和利润就是亏损。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.52,0:35:06.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, it's really important to realize that this is when this is an example of an AI infrastructure coming online.\N因此，真正重要的是要意识到，这就是AI基础设施上线的一个例子。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.16,0:35:09.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,It could take It could be coming online quickly.\N它可能很快就能上线。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.75,0:35:11.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,It could take a while.\N也可能需要一段时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.60,0:35:12.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Its throughput could be high.\N它的吞吐量可能很高。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.98,0:35:14.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,It could be low.\N也可能很低。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.64,0:35:17.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Its resilience and reliability could be good or bad.\N它的韧性和可靠性可能好也可能差。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.82,0:35:23.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And its lifetime of usefulness could be long or short.\N它的实用寿命可能很长，也可能很短。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.32,0:35:34.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because this represents 50, 60, going to 100 billion dollars, this curve matters greatly.\N因为这代表了500亿、600亿，甚至达到1000亿美元，这条曲线至关重要。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.60,0:35:42.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which is the reason why NVIDIA is such a great partner working with us because of our fully integrated capability,\N这正是英伟达成为我们如此出色合作伙伴的原因，因为我们具备完全集成的能力。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.72,0:35:45.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,we didn't just come up with a PowerPoint slide.\N我们不只是做了一张PPT幻灯片。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.64,0:35:48.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,We created the entire infrastructure.\N我们构建了整个基础设施。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.05,0:35:49.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,We connected everything together.\N我们把所有东西都连接在一起了。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.01,0:35:56.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,We built out billions and billions of it ourselves to make sure that everything works well.\N我们自己构建了数十亿个这样的组件，以确保一切都能正常运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.60,0:36:04.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,As a result of that, our time our time to first token, our time to first token,\N因此，我们的首词元时间，也就是首词元时间，
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.49,0:36:12.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,our time to first inference our time to training turned on is much faster.\N我们的首次推理时间以及训练启动时间都快得多。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.52,0:36:22.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Second, because our throughput per watt, our tokens per watt is utterly world-class.\N第二，我们的每瓦特吞吐量，每瓦特词元数，堪称世界顶级。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.96,0:36:25.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is because we integrate everything.\N原因在于我们实现了全栈整合。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.52,0:36:27.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,We design everything from the ground up.\N我们从零开始设计所有组件。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.06,0:36:31.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,We simulate the entire system and we use extreme co-design.\N我们对整个系统进行仿真，并采用极致的协同设计。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.32,0:36:39.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just like I showed you just now with the Vera Rubin rack, everything was designed in order to deliver on this incredible throughput.\N就像我刚才展示的 Vera Rubin 机架一样，所有设计都是为了实现如此惊人的吞吐性能。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.96,0:36:48.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,If your data center, if your factory has 1 gigawatt, it will not have more.\N如果你的数据中心或工厂有 1 吉瓦的电力，那就不会再多。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.04,0:36:51.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,1 gigawatt means 1 gigawatt.\N1 吉瓦就是 1 吉瓦。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.60,0:36:54.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's all the power generation you could do.\N这就是你能实现的全部发电能力。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.56,0:37:04.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you have 1 gigawatt of power, then throughput per watt is revenues because every token is profitable.\N如果你有1吉瓦的电力，那么每瓦特的吞吐量就是收入，因为每个词元都是盈利的。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.96,0:37:07.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every token is revenues.\N每个词元都是收入。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.96,0:37:09.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the future.\N这就是未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.76,0:37:11.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Compute is revenues.\N计算即收入。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.26,0:37:13.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Performance per watt is your revenues.\N每瓦特的性能就是你的收入。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.04,0:37:21.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Choosing the wrong architecture just because the chips are cheaper doesn't translate.\N仅仅因为芯片更便宜就选择错误的架构，是无法带来实际效益的。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.84,0:37:23.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Doesn't make sense.\N这说不通。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.64,0:37:30.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need to make sure that your revenues per watt the more you buy, the more you make.\N你需要确保，每瓦特的收入随着你购买的增加而增加。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.92,0:37:36.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so tokens per watt and then lastly very last Oh, second.\N然后是每瓦特的词元数，最后，非常最后，第二点。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.44,0:37:39.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Third is reliability.\N第三是可靠性。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.32,0:37:46.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you ever get a chance to see these data centers, there are so many moving parts, millions of cables.\N如果你有机会参观这些数据中心，会发现里面有数以百万计的线缆和大量活动部件。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.20,0:37:53.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,The ability for all of those computers to work harmoniously, reliably, is extremely low.\N让所有这些计算机协同、可靠地运行的能力，极其低下。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.34,0:37:55.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is just extremely difficult.\N这实在太难了。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.56,0:38:00.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have now been operating very large scale for a very long time.\N我们已经长时间大规模运行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.07,0:38:02.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,That experience matters.\N这种经验至关重要。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.32,0:38:08.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,That difference mean time between interrupts extremely important.\N这种中断之间的平均时间间隔极为重要。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.23,0:38:12.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then lastly this is very hard.\N然后最后，这非常困难。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.32,0:38:19.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The lifetime of these systems, the lifetime of these systems the software is changing all the time.\N这些系统的生命周期，这些系统的软件一直在不断变化。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.28,0:38:23.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,4 years ago which is in the time of Hopper.\N四年前，也就是霍珀时代。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.36,0:38:26.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI has completely changed.\N人工智能已经彻底改变了。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.12,0:38:33.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Six years ago, this is the time frame of Ampere, AI has completely changed.\N六年前，那是安培的时代，人工智能已经彻底改变了。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.16,0:38:35.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,We started out talking about CNNs.\N我们一开始讨论的是卷积神经网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.00,0:38:40.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here we are, then we talked about Transformers, and then we talked about mixture of experts.\N现在我们讨论的是变换器，接着是专家混合模型。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.04,0:38:43.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now we're talking about agentic systems.\N现在我们讨论的是代理式系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.04,0:38:52.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every single generation, every single few months, the software industry is coming up with new technology.\N每一代产品，每过几个月，软件行业就会推出新技术。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.60,0:39:02.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,If your architecture is not flexible, if your ecosystem is not rich, then this curve cannot be long.\N如果你的架构不够灵活，生态不够丰富，那么这条曲线就无法持续很长。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.04,0:39:07.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,You cannot predict how long your system can last.\N你无法预测你的系统能用多久。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.53,0:39:08.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can.\N我可以。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.72,0:39:11.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia systems is all over the world.\N英伟达的系统遍布全球。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.48,0:39:22.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Software developers start with Nvidia CUDA, and by definition, therefore, the life, the ecosystem, the useful asset is going to be much longer.\N软件开发者从英伟达 CUDA 开始，因此，从定义上讲，系统的生命力、生态和实用资产的寿命都会更长。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.74,0:39:25.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,The difference is essentially cost.\N本质上区别在于成本。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.15,0:39:30.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,You could think of it as revenues, but the other side of revenues is cost.\N你可以把它看作收入，但收入的另一面就是成本。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.28,0:39:35.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the life of the asset is long, the TCO is low.\N如果资产寿命长，总拥有成本就低。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.48,0:39:37.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the difference.\N这就是区别所在。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.30,0:39:46.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is what it looks like when compute The more you buy,\N这就是计算能力的体现：你买得越多，
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.32,0:39:54.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,the more you make.\N你赚得就越多。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.92,0:39:58.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, all of you are experiencing this with me.\N现在，你们所有人正和我一起经历这一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.91,0:40:00.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?\N没错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.72,0:40:12.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of your demand, your factories are working so hard, your people are working so hard all across Taiwan, because everybody wants to make money.\N你们所有的需求，你们的工厂都在全力运转，台湾各地的人们都在拼命工作，因为每个人都想赚钱。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.24,0:40:17.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,They realize that AI, useful AI is here.\N他们意识到，实用的AI已经来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.36,0:40:20.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Profitable AI is here.\N盈利的AI已经来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.44,0:40:26.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Compute demand is incredibly high and compute demand is the constraint.\N计算需求极高，而计算需求正是瓶颈所在。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.99,0:40:33.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, let's go work super super hard and help the world stand up AI factories everywhere.\N所以，让我们全力以赴，帮助全世界建立起AI工厂。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.52,0:40:35.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is why it's so important.\N这就是为什么它如此重要。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.05,0:40:36.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.\N我太高兴了。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.92,0:40:39.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here I am standing in front of you.\N我就站在这里，面对着你们。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.76,0:40:47.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin is in full production.\N维拉·鲁宾已全面投产。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.28,0:40:51.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin is in full production.\N维拉·鲁宾已全面投产。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.40,0:41:01.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,It the the supply chain we created for Vera Rubin is twice as large as Grace Blackwell.\N为 Vera Rubin 构建的供应链规模是 Grace Blackwell 的两倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.08,0:41:04.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not Yeah, it's incredible.\N不，这太惊人了。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.29,0:41:12.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And And what used to take 2 hours to assemble one Grace Blackwell rack now only takes 5 minutes.\N以前组装一个 Grace Blackwell 机架需要两个小时，现在只需五分钟。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.60,0:41:17.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, not only is the capacity higher, the throughput is a lot faster.\N因此，不仅产能更高，吞吐量也快得多。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.44,0:41:21.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we need it all to support the demand.\N我们需要这一切来支撑需求。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.56,0:41:24.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This ecosystem is extraordinary.\N这个生态系统非同寻常。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.76,0:41:33.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Millions of square feet has been put online to support Grace Blackwell and preparing now, ramping up now, Vera Rubin.\N数百万平方英尺的设施已投入使用，以支持 Grace Blackwell，\N并正在为 Vera Rubin 的量产做准备，目前正加速推进。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.27,0:41:34.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to thank all of you.\N我想感谢在座的每一位。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.84,0:41:36.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin is now in full production.\NVera Rubin 现已全面投入生产。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.81,0:41:41.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.64,0:41:45.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.\N我们来看一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.88,0:41:49.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Large language models generate answers.\N大型语言模型生成答案。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.52,0:41:52.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now AI agents can do work.\N现在，AI 智能体可以完成工作了。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.20,0:41:56.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,But processing agentic AI is a whole different kind of problem.\N但处理代理式 AI 是一个完全不同的问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.62,0:42:00.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agents observe, reason, plan, use tools.\N智能体观察、推理、规划、使用工具。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.14,0:42:04.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,They manage massive context, juggling working memory and long-term memory.\N它们管理着庞大的上下文，同时处理工作记忆和长期记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.64,0:42:08.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,They spin up sub agents, specialists on demand.\N它们可随时启动子智能体，按需调用专家。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.64,0:42:16.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia Vera Rubin is a multi-rack pod scale system built to process a gentic AI and is now in full production.\N英伟达 Vera Rubin 是一款专为处理代理式\NAI 而设计的多机架 Pod 规模系统，现已投入全面生产。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.65,0:42:22.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The manufacturing, automation, and orchestration across the supply chain, a miracle to witness.\N供应链中制造、自动化与协同调度的全过程，堪称奇迹。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.00,0:42:28.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our journey started when we launched the first AI supercomputer, Nvidia DGX-1.\N我们的旅程始于推出首款 AI 超级计算机——英伟达 DGX-1。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.80,0:42:33.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Over the next decade, we pushed every chip and system to the limit.\N在接下来的十年里，我们不断将每颗芯片和系统推向极限。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.16,0:42:39.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,From Pascal and the first NVLink to Grace Blackwell, the first rack-scale AI supercomputer.\N从 Pascal 和首款 NVLink，\N到 Grace Blackwell——首款机架级 AI 超级计算机。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.72,0:42:46.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now, Vera Rubin, the first multi-rack pod scale supercomputer built for the agentic age.\N如今，Vera Rubin 成为首款专为代理式时代打造的多机架 Pod 规模超级计算机。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.84,0:42:48.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,It starts at TSMC.\N它始于台积电。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.30,0:42:53.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,The seven new chips that make up Vera Rubin take shape through hundreds of processing steps.\N组成维拉·鲁宾的七款新芯片通过数百道加工步骤成型。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.82,0:43:03.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,3 nanometer process, CoWoS R and CoWoS L packaging, HBM4 memory from Micron, SK Hynix, and Samsung.\N3 纳米工艺，CoWoS R 与 CoWoS L 封装，美光、SK 海力士和三星的 HBM4 内存。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.28,0:43:10.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Vera Rubin compute 6 trillion transistors with over 18,000 components on one board.\N维拉·鲁宾计算芯片拥有 6 万亿晶体管，单块电路板上集成超过 18,000 个组件。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.88,0:43:17.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin NVL72 does the thinking, prompt and context understanding, reasoning, and planning.\N维拉·鲁宾 NVL72 负责思考、提示与上下文理解、推理与规划。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.92,0:43:27.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Next, a new modular compute tray, streamlined with a new PCB midplane design, superchips, ConnectX-9 super NICs,\N接下来是新型模块化计算托盘，采用新型 PCB 中板设计，\N集成超芯片、ConnectX-9 超高速网卡，
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.72,0:43:34.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,and BlueField-4 DPUs all mate in place with no cables for resiliency at AI factory scale.\N以及 BlueField-4 DPU，全部就位且无需电缆连接，实现 AI 工厂级别的高可靠性。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.70,0:43:41.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,18 compute trays, nine hot-swappable NVLink switch trays, new high-efficiency manifolds,\N18 个计算托盘，9 个可热插拔的 NVLink 交换托盘，新型高效率集流管，
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.96,0:43:49.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,liquid-cooled bus bars carrying over 5,000 amps, the equivalent of 20 electric cars at full acceleration.\N液冷母排承载超过 5,000 安培电流，相当于 20 辆电动车全速加速的电力需求。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.80,0:43:55.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Together, 1.3 million components form this third-generation MGX rack design.\N共同构成这一代 MGX 机架设计的 130 万个组件。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.88,0:44:01.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Congratulations to Microsoft for their operational Vera Rubin NVL72 engineering rack.\N向微软致以祝贺，祝贺其成功部署运营级的维拉·鲁宾 NVL72 工程机架。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.31,0:44:08.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Congratulations to Dell and CoreWeave as well for standing up their Vera Rubin NVL72 engineering rack.\N同样祝贺戴尔和 CoreWeave，祝贺它们成功搭建起自己的维拉·鲁宾 NVL72 工程机架。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.52,0:44:11.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then, the Vera CPU rack.\N然后是维拉·鲁宾 CPU 机架。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.90,0:44:15.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,256 CPUs in a single liquid-cooled rack.\N单个液冷机架内配备 256 个 CPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.72,0:44:17.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Orchestrating the models.\N协调模型运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.60,0:44:18.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shuffling memory.\N交换内存。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.00,0:44:20.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Launching tools.\N启动工具。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.64,0:44:25.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,At Foxconn and Quanta, Groq 3 LPX takes shape.\N在富士康和广达，Groq 3 LPX 正在成型。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.10,0:44:29.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,256 Groq 3 LPUs across 16 trays.\N16 个托盘上共部署 256 个 Groq 3 LPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.23,0:44:34.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,40 petabytes per second of SRAM bandwidth for ultra-low latency.\NSRAM 带宽达每秒 40 PB，实现超低延迟。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.56,0:44:43.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,While NVL72 generates tokens at the highest throughput, Groq LPX generates them at the lowest latency.\N当 NVL72 以最高吞吐量生成词元时，Groq LPX 以最低延迟生成词元。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.12,0:44:47.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera BlueField 4 STX, where AI keeps its memory.\NVera BlueField 4 STX，AI 保持其内存的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.52,0:44:50.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Storage processing accelerated by BlueField 4.\N由 BlueField 4 加速的存储处理。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.69,0:44:55.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Connecting memory, storage, and in-silicon security.\N连接内存、存储与芯片内安全。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.84,0:44:59.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And NVIDIA Spectrum-X Ethernet photonics.\N以及英伟达 Spectrum-X 以太网光子学技术。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.28,0:45:04.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The world's first Ethernet switch with 200 gigabit co-packaged optics.\N全球首款采用200吉比特共封装光子技术的以太网交换机。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.48,0:45:13.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,TSMC's CoWoS process, chip-scale packaging, and ultra-high-powered laser diodes on indium phosphide.\N台积电的CoWoS工艺、芯片级封装，以及基于磷化铟的超大功率激光二极管。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.20,0:45:14.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin.\N维拉·鲁宾。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.52,0:45:16.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Five connected rack-scale systems.\N五个互联的机架级系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.60,0:45:19.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,A supercomputer for AI agents.\N专为AI智能体打造的超级计算机。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.36,0:45:22.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,150 supply chain partners across Taiwan.\N台湾地区拥有150家供应链合作伙伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.04,0:45:25.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Millions of square feet of factory floor.\N数百万平方英尺的工厂车间面积。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.80,0:45:33.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hundreds of sites, chips, packages, systems, and data centers pushed to the limits of size, power, and scale.\N数以百计的站点、芯片、封装、系统和数据中心，均已达到尺寸、功耗与规模的极限。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.01,0:45:37.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is what we call extreme co-design.\N这就是我们所说的极致协同设计。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.28,0:45:38.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,We did this with Taiwan.\N我们与台湾共同完成了这一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.88,0:45:42.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Together, we reinvented computing for the age of AI.\N我们携手重新定义了AI时代的计算。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.28,0:45:48.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Taiwan was with us at the beginning and here today as we bring Vera Rubin to the world.\N台湾从一开始就与我们同行，如今也正与我们一同将维拉·鲁宾推向世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.68,0:45:57.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Taiwan.\N谢谢你，台湾。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.56,0:46:01.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, Vera Rubin.\N各位女士们、先生们，欢迎 Vera Rubin。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.80,0:46:06.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin was not just built for AI.\NVera Rubin 不仅是为 AI 而打造的。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.52,0:46:09.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI Vera Rubin was not built just to run AI.\NVera Rubin 并非仅仅用于运行 AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.65,0:46:13.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin was built to run agents.\NVera Rubin 是为运行智能体而设计的。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.68,0:46:16.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is an agentic system.\N这是一个代理式系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.31,0:46:24.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Imagine the complexity, which is the reason why agents is the last computer science breakthrough.\N想象一下其中的复杂性，这正是智能体成为计算机科学最后重大突破的原因。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.47,0:46:29.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has taken this many years for agents to realize its potential and become useful.\N智能体花了这么多年的积累，才真正实现其潜力并变得实用。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.84,0:46:34.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,It stands to reason that the computer that runs it is the most advanced in the world.\N因此，能够运行它的计算机，必然是世界上最先进的。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.66,0:46:36.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Vera Rubin.\N这就是 Vera Rubin。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.08,0:46:37.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.\N让我们来看一看。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.30,0:46:38.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Can we bring out Vera Rubin,\N我们能请出 Vera Rubin 吗，
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.72,0:46:59.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,please?\N请？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.52,0:47:07.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Engineering, do we have the Do we have the racks, the systems?\N工程部，我们有机架和系统吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.24,0:47:10.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,It looks heavy.\N看起来很重。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.64,0:47:12.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is This is Vera Rubin.\N这就是维拉·鲁宾。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.02,0:47:16.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin NVLink 72.\N维拉·鲁宾 NVLink 72。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.44,0:47:18.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the Groq LPX.\N这是 Groq LPX。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.76,0:47:22.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,At the next GTC, I'm going to talk to you about a lot more of this.\N在下届 GTC 上，我将和大家深入探讨更多相关内容。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.52,0:47:25.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, we have so much to talk to you about.\N今天，我们有太多内容要和大家分享。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.92,0:47:29.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Vera's CPU rack.\N这是维拉的 CPU 机架。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.38,0:47:31.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,256 CPUs, all liquid cooled.\N256 个 CPU，全部采用液冷。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.54,0:47:34.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you about Vera in just a moment.\N我稍后会向大家详细介绍维拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.30,0:47:41.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the Vera BlueField storage processing system and also security system.\N这是维拉的 BlueField 存储处理系统，同时也是安全系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.79,0:47:49.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And of course, this is our Mellanox networking, the world's first CPO.\N当然，这是我们自研的 Mellanox 网络技术，全球首款 CPO。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.12,0:47:50.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Vera Rubin.\N这就是 Vera Rubin。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.38,0:47:53.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Incredible technology all coming together.\N这些令人惊叹的技术终于汇聚在一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.28,0:48:00.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, when we built When we built Hopper, we built Hopper, as you know, for pre-training.\N当我们打造 Hopper 时，正如大家所知，我们是为预训练而设计的。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.28,0:48:05.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pre-training was the most important application, the most important workload we were working on at the time.\N预训练是当时最重要、最核心的应用和工作负载。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.76,0:48:13.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then when we worked on Grace Hopper Blackwell everybody said, "Jensen, you know, Nvidia is really good at pre-training.\N后来我们开发 Grace Hopper Blackwell 时，所有人都说：\N“黄，你知道，英伟达在预训练方面确实非常擅长。”
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.96,0:48:15.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Inference is so easy."\N推理太简单了。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.38,0:48:17.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you remember that?\N你还记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.44,0:48:19.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,People used to say, "Inference is so easy.\N人们过去常说：“推理太简单了。”
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.61,0:48:21.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,We could do that, too."\N我们也能做到。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.40,0:48:24.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,But as you know, inference equals money.\N但正如大家所知，推理就是钱。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.68,0:48:28.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the models, MOEs are so complicated.\N而这些模型，特别是 MOE，复杂得惊人。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.48,0:48:38.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And to do it at incredibly high response time fast interactivity, and high throughput at the same time is incredibly hard.\N同时实现极低的响应时间、极高的交互速度和极高的吞吐量，这非常困难。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.36,0:48:41.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which is the reason why we created NVLink 72.\N这正是我们开发 NVLink 72 的原因。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.76,0:48:46.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, Nvidia's token cost is the lowest in the world.\N如今，英伟达的词元成本是全球最低的。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.68,0:48:51.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not by 10%, by X factors, orders of magnitude.\N不是降低 10%，而是降低 X 倍，数量级的降幅。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.84,0:48:54.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,All because we did extreme co-design.\N正因为我们进行了极致的协同设计。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.96,0:49:03.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,All because we understood the computing model, the computing pattern of inference and we were able to create NVLink 72.\N正因为我们理解了推理的计算模型和计算模式，才能创造出 NVLink 72。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.72,0:49:08.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now with Vera Rubin it is beyond inference.\N如今，Vera Rubin 已超越了推理。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.73,0:49:12.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is now inference in an agentic agentic system.\N它现在是在一个代理式系统中的推理。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.76,0:49:15.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Vera Rubin.\N这就是 Vera Rubin。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.00,0:49:21.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,No cables no hoses, no fans.\N没有电缆，没有管道，没有风扇。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.96,0:49:28.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,What used to take the last time when I showed this to you, we had cables everywhere.\N上次我向你们展示时，到处都是电缆。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.16,0:49:30.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cables were amazing to look at.\N那些电缆看起来非常惊艳。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.72,0:49:36.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,But now there's a PCB in the middle which connects both sides.\N但现在中间有一块PCB连接了两侧。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.28,0:49:39.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,What used to take 2 hours now takes 5 minutes.\N以前需要2小时，现在只需5分钟。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.50,0:49:45.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The reliability and the resilience of Vera Rubin is going to be off the charts.\N维拉·鲁宾的可靠性和韧性将远超以往。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.72,0:49:49.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is our Vera CPU tray.\N这是我们的维拉CPU托盘。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.28,0:49:52.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,The most advanced CPUs that has ever been built.\N有史以来最先进的CPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.81,0:49:55.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm going to show you that in just a second.\N我马上就要向你们展示。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.64,0:49:59.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is our storage tray.\N这是我们的存储托盘。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.84,0:50:07.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Two Vera CPUs, four CX 9, incredible amounts of software.\N两颗维拉CPU，四块CX 9，海量的软件。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.80,0:50:17.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is our new LPX LPU 30, the Groq system designed for very low latency inference.\N这是我们的新型LPX LPU 30，专为极低延迟推理设计的Groq系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.16,0:50:23.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,The throughput is delivered by Vera Rubin and extended with NVLink 72.\N通过维拉·鲁宾实现吞吐量，并通过NVLink 72进行扩展。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.88,0:50:29.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want to extend that even further, you can have Groq LPUs.\N如果还想进一步扩展，可以加入Groq LPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.72,0:50:33.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here, we have the Vera Rubin NVLink, the switch tray.\N这里是维拉·鲁宾NVLink和交换托盘。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.54,0:50:38.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the switches in the middle, and this is revolutionary.\N这是中间的交换机，非常具有革命性。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.52,0:50:46.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because of Vera Rubins, because of NVLink 72, and the NVLink switches that we created and invented,\N正是因为 Vera Rubin，因为 NVLink 72，以及我们自主研发的 NVLink 交换机，
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.36,0:50:52.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,and this is our Ethernet switches for scale out.\N这是我们用于横向扩展的以太网交换机。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.24,0:50:58.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's amazing is we introduced these two systems for Grace Blackwell.\N令人惊叹的是，我们为 Grace Blackwell 推出了这两套系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.96,0:51:07.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,These two systems were created for Grace Blackwell, and today, NVIDIA is the largest networking company in the world.\N这两套系统专为 Grace Blackwell 打造，如今英伟达已成为全球最大的网络公司。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.48,0:51:10.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud of the networking team.\N我为网络团队感到无比自豪。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.12,0:51:14.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is such an incredible enabler for everything that we do.\N这对我们的所有工作来说都是一个不可思议的赋能。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.68,0:51:21.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm going to now talk to you about the next major industry we're going to be part of.\N接下来，我想和大家聊聊我们即将参与的下一个重大产业。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.16,0:51:22.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.32,0:51:24.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jen-Hsun.\N陈立武。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.52,0:51:30.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.48,0:51:35.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jensen.\N黄仁勋。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.92,0:51:44.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think there are 2,000 people back there pulling that.\N我觉得背后有两千人正在推动这件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.60,0:51:49.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's talk about CPUs.\N好，我们来谈谈 CPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.56,0:51:51.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera CPUs.\N维拉 CPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.28,0:51:54.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,CPUs built for the age of AI.\N专为 AI 时代打造的 CPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.52,0:52:00.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of the CPUs until now were created for people.\N以往所有的 CPU 都是为人类设计的。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.28,0:52:02.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,We were the users.\N我们是使用者。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.72,0:52:04.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,We were the users.\N我们是使用者。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.45,0:52:06.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,We were the renters.\N我们是租户。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.36,0:52:12.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,The way we use CPUs, we live in a world counted by seconds.\N我们使用 CPU 的方式，让我们生活在一个以秒为单位的世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.24,0:52:21.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,The way we rent CPUs in the cloud, each one of them more you can more CPU cores you have, the more you can rent.\N我们在云端租用 CPU 时，核心越多，能租用的就越多。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.16,0:52:30.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The economics of the old the use case of the old CPU and the economics of the old CPU fundamentally different than agents.\N旧 CPU 的使用场景及其经济模式，与智能体的根本不同。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.28,0:52:33.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agents are impatient.\N智能体没有耐心。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.88,0:52:35.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,They don't live in a world that is in seconds.\N他们生活在一个以纳秒为单位的世界里，而不是以秒为单位。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.88,0:52:39.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,They live in a world that's in nanoseconds.\N他们生活在一个以纳秒为单位的世界里。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.16,0:52:45.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,When it uses a tool, it wants the response time to be as fast as possible.\N当它使用工具时，希望响应时间尽可能快。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.56,0:52:50.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,When it access database, it has to come back as soon as possible.\N当它访问数据库时，必须尽快返回结果。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.28,0:52:58.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every moment that the agent is waiting keeps it from going to the next step, the next step, the next step.\N智能体每多等待一瞬，就错失一次推进到下一步的机会，错失下一次，错失下下一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.72,0:53:07.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is vital that we make the CPUs as low latency as possible, as interactive as possible.\N我们必须将CPU的延迟降到最低，交互性做到极致，这一点至关重要。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.76,0:53:12.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we created Vera CPU for the age of AI.\N因此，我们为AI时代打造了Vera CPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.08,0:53:15.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, inside our system, it's used for three different ways.\N现在，在我们的系统中，它有三种不同的用途。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.83,0:53:23.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first way, of course, is Vera Rubin for thinking.\N第一种用途，当然是用于Vera Rubin的思考。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.48,0:53:28.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And inside the Vera Rubin rack, there already two CPUs.\N在Vera Rubin机架内部，已经配备了两颗CPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.32,0:53:34.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,As you know, we are building and selling millions of Vera Rubins.\N如你所知，我们正在制造并销售数百万台Vera Rubins。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.00,0:53:38.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have sold millions of Grace Blackwells.\N我们已经售出数百万台Grace Blackwell。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.13,0:53:42.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia already is one of the largest CPU makers in the world.\N英伟达已经是全球最大的CPU制造商之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.24,0:53:46.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera In the Vera Rubin rack are two CPUs.\N在Vera Rubin机架中配备了两颗CPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.28,0:53:54.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,One for orchestrating and managing the GPUs, managing the KV cache,\N一颗用于协调和管理GPU，管理键值缓存，
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.36,0:53:58.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,dealing with all of the software that runs in the rack.\N处理机架中运行的所有软件。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.44,0:54:05.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We also have the Grace BlueField that is used for security and isolation.\N我们还配备了Grace BlueField，用于安全和隔离。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.20,0:54:15.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Vera compute is used for the harness, the orchestration of the AI models, tool use, accessing the database.\NVera计算单元用于智能体运行框架、AI模型的协调、工具调用以及数据库访问。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.28,0:54:20.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the data servers are right here, Vera BlueField.\N数据服务器就在这里，Vera BlueField。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.20,0:54:26.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,The fastest storage fastest storage servers, the fastest storage system the world has ever made.\N最快的存储服务器，最快的存储系统，世界上迄今为止制造的最快存储系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.56,0:54:34.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason why this is so vital is because agents are accessing memory, accessing memory so incredibly fast.\N这之所以至关重要，是因为智能体正在以极快的速度访问内存。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.04,0:54:46.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,These systems, the storage server and the CPUs are now the critical path of the most expensive part of the data center.\N这些系统，包括存储服务器和CPU，现在已成为数据中心最昂贵部分的关键路径。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.68,0:54:50.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the most expensive for a good reason.\N这确实非常昂贵，但有充分的理由。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.48,0:54:57.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The economics the economics of the AI factory is tokens.\NAI工厂的经济核心是词元。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.40,0:55:00.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the tokens are created here.\N词元就在这里生成。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.16,0:55:05.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so of course you want to manufacture and generate as many tokens as possible.\N因此你当然希望尽可能多地制造和生成词元。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.20,0:55:07.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is where you put all of your economics.\N这里是你放置所有经济模型的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.58,0:55:11.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this has to not be in the way.\N而且它必须不成为障碍。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.16,0:55:21.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so Vera CPU has great pressure on the Vera on the CPU architecture, which is the reason why we built a brand new architecture from the ground up.\N因此 Vera CPU 在 CPU 架构上承受着巨大压力，这也是我们从零开始打造全新架构的原因。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.54,0:55:24.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,A CPU the world has never seen before.\N这是世界前所未见的 CPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.16,0:55:26.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,We call it Vera.\N我们称它为 Vera。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.52,0:55:30.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is CPU for agents.\N这是为智能体设计的 CPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.48,0:55:34.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,All the CPUs of the past we built for humans.\N过去我们打造的所有 CPU 都是为人类设计的。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.44,0:55:37.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This CPU is built for agents.\N这款 CPU 是为智能体打造的。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.40,0:55:39.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, there four things to keep in mind.\N好，有四点需要牢记。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.96,0:55:41.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The four takeaways.\N这四个要点。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.92,0:55:52.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first takeaway is that the instructions per clock of Vera has to be incredibly good because we need the latency to be short.\N第一个要点是，Vera 的每时钟指令数必须非常出色，因为我们需要保持低延迟。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.08,0:56:02.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,We need the processing time, single threaded performance, not throughput, single threaded performance has to be world-class, absolutely the best.\N我们需要的是处理时间，单线程性能，而不是吞吐量，单线程性能必须达到世界级，绝对是最顶尖的。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.40,0:56:09.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Single threaded performance, which is the reason why the IPC, the instructions per clock of Vera is so high.\N单线程性能，正是 Vera 每时钟指令数（IPC）如此高的原因。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.44,0:56:11.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the highest in the world.\N这是全球最高的。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.48,0:56:16.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,10 instructions fetch, decoded, and executed per clock.\N每时钟周期可获取、解码并执行 10 条指令。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.20,0:56:17.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Number one.\N第一。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.84,0:56:19.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Number two.\N第二。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.68,0:56:27.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The bandwidth necessary to move data in and out for the CPU has to be utterly world-class.\NCPU 数据进出所需的带宽必须是绝对的世界级水平。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.20,0:56:30.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second thing is bandwidth per core.\N第二点是每核心带宽。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.72,0:56:33.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The third is just bandwidth, period.\N第三点就是带宽本身。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.92,0:56:43.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're moving Remember, I said earlier, agentic systems is fundamentally disaggregated and distributed.\N我们在移动，还记得我之前说过的吗？代理式系统本质上是解耦且分布式的。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.48,0:56:45.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disaggregated and distributed.\N解耦且分布式的。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.79,0:56:51.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,When computing is disaggregated and distributed, networking becomes the problem.\N当计算被解耦并分布式部署时，网络就变成了核心问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.84,0:57:02.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Therefore, we have to move the data around as fast as possible between the CPU cores and between the CPU and the storage, the CPU and the GPU.\N因此，我们必须尽可能快速地在 CPU 核心之间、CPU 与存储之间、\NCPU 与 GPU 之间传输数据。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.28,0:57:09.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The bandwidth around the system and inside the CPU core has to be utterly world-class.\N系统内外的带宽以及 CPU 核心内部的带宽必须达到世界顶级水平。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.40,0:57:14.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the first CPU that's been built a long time that is literally at theoretical\N这是很久以来第一款真正逼近理论极限的 CPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.86,0:57:21.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,limits with a fabric that connects all of the CPU cores that is speed of light.\N它采用了一种连接所有 CPU 核心的架构，其传输速度接近光速。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.64,0:57:24.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,3.6 terabytes per second.\N3.6 太字节每秒。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.72,0:57:26.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,No chiplet tax,\N没有芯片小片税，
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.68,0:57:36.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,no chip boundary crossings because we need to have everything because the CPU cores are talking to each other with extremely high bandwidth.\N无需跨越芯片边界，因为我们需要所有部件紧密协作，CPU 核心之间必须以极高的带宽通信。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.41,0:57:39.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're not rented core per core per core.\N它们不是按核心租赁的。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.23,0:57:41.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're all working together.\N它们都在协同工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.84,0:57:45.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cross-sectional bandwidth of Vera is off the charts.\NVera 的横向带宽高得惊人。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.06,0:57:49.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the first one to be PCI Express Gen 6.\N它是首款支持 PCI Express Gen 6 的处理器。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.20,0:57:56.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is also the first one to have LPDDR5 with 1.2 terabytes per second.\N它也是首个配备 LPDDR5、带宽高达每秒 1.2 太字节的芯片。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.88,0:58:06.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Three times two to three times the bandwidth of the highest performance CPUs on the outside three times the bandwidth on the inside.\N外部最高性能 CPU 带宽的三倍，内部带宽更是其三倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.80,0:58:11.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The bandwidth per core and the bandwidth period is world class.\N每核心带宽和带宽周期均属世界顶尖水平。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.60,0:58:19.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, remember I showed you earlier the number of CPU cores, the number of CPUs is going to be quite high.\N现在，请记住我之前向你们展示的 CPU 核心数量，CPU 数量将会非常高。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.60,0:58:23.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is very simple.\N原因非常简单。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.36,0:58:28.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,We created CPUs for humans in the past.\N过去我们为人类设计 CPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.28,0:58:32.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And humans, they're only 1 billion of us.\N而人类只有约 10 亿人。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.08,0:58:35.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,There will be billions of agents.\N未来将有数十亿智能体。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.48,0:58:45.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And these agents are going to be using the CPUs with very little patience because the cost of the GPU they sit next to is too high.\N这些智能体对 CPU 的使用将极为急切，因为它们旁边 GPU 的成本过高。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.08,0:58:49.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And therefore too valuable, too precious.\N因此，这些 CPU 也过于宝贵、过于珍贵。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.56,0:58:59.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Therefore, these CPUs are going to be both performant but they also have to be extremely energy efficient.\N所以这些 CPU 必须兼具高性能和极高的能效。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.20,0:59:10.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that we can cram as much CPUs we can into the factory without taking away power from the token generation, which we know is how we make money.\N这样我们才能在不占用词元生成电力的前提下，尽可能多地塞入 CPU，而词元生成正是我们赚钱的方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.92,0:59:12.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,These four properties,\N这四个特性，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.32,0:59:19.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,instructions per clock or single-threaded performance bandwidth per core the total bandwidth\N每时钟周期指令数或单线程性能、每核带宽以及芯片内外的总带宽
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.84,0:59:25.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,around the chip and inside the chip and energy efficiency defines Vera.\N和能效共同定义了 Vera。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.60,0:59:27.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is absolutely world class.\N它绝对属于世界级水平。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.79,0:59:33.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you compare it to the highest performance x86, it is just off the charts.\N与最高性能的 x86 处理器相比，它的表现简直超乎想象。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.56,0:59:42.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you compare it in real single-threaded performance, real performance, it's off the charts.\N在实际单线程性能上进行对比，它的表现同样超乎想象。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.68,0:59:46.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is incredible to be able to deliver 5% improvement on CPUs.\N能够在 CPU 上实现 5% 的性能提升，已经令人难以置信。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.04,0:59:50.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is incredible to be able to deliver 10%.\N能够实现 10% 的提升，更是令人难以置信。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.88,0:59:55.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this kind of performance speed up is just unheard of.\N但这种程度的性能提升，此前从未听说过。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.20,0:59:58.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Nvidia Vera.\N这就是英伟达 Vera。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.64,1:00:05.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you think?\N你怎么看？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.64,1:00:08.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.\N我们来一起看看。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.12,1:00:11.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,A generative AI changes the role of the CPU.\N生成式 AI 改变了 CPU 的角色。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.60,1:00:15.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,The CPU is now the conductor and the GPU is the orchestra.\N现在 CPU 是指挥家，GPU 是交响乐团。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.88,1:00:21.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Traditional CPUs were built for a different era, maximizing cores per socket.\N传统 CPU 是为另一个时代设计的，追求每插槽核心数的最大化。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.61,1:00:25.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Slice them up, virtualize, rent by the hour.\N将其切分、虚拟化，按小时出租。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.88,1:00:36.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the age of agents, the CPU is now a bottleneck to GPU utilization, directly affecting token throughput, latency, and user experience.\N在智能体时代，CPU 成为 GPU 利用率的瓶颈，直接影响词元吞吐量、延迟和用户体验。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.52,1:00:40.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia Vera is the CPU built for the agentic loop,\N英伟达 Vera 是专为智能体循环打造的 CPU，
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.15,1:00:45.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,combining Nvidia's custom data center CPU core with a scalable coherency fabric for\N将英伟达定制的数据中心 CPU 核心与可扩展的一致性互连架构相结合，
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.84,1:00:50.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,the right balance of performance cores and bandwidth to maximize AI factory output.\N实现性能核心与带宽的完美平衡，以最大化 AI 工厂的产出。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.04,1:00:56.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,At the heart of Vera is the Nvidia Olympus core, built for modern data center workloads,\NVera 的核心是英伟达 Olympus 核心，专为现代数据中心工作负载设计，
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.81,1:01:02.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,branch-heavy Python runtimes, tool calls, and sandbox code execution.\N适用于分支密集的 Python 运行时、工具调用和沙箱代码执行。
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.56,1:01:05.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each core is tuned for throughput.\N每个核心都针对吞吐量进行了优化。
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.13,1:01:13.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,A neural branch predictor evaluating two taken branches per cycle, a 10-wide decode engine brings in more work each cycle.\N采用神经分支预测器，每周期可评估两个已执行分支，10 宽度解码引擎每周期引入更多任务。
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.32,1:01:16.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,A large out-of-order engine keeps instructions moving.\N一个大型乱序执行引擎确保指令持续流动。
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.42,1:01:21.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Advanced prefetchers with a novel graph engine anticipating the next data path.\N采用创新图引擎的先进预取器，可预测下一个数据路径。
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.62,1:01:27.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,But fast cores only matter when data arrives correctly and on time.\N但若数据未能及时准确到达，高速核心也毫无意义。
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.20,1:01:36.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera is the first CPU to use LPDDR5X memory while correcting multiple errors simultaneously without compromising bandwidth.\NVera 是首款在同时纠正多个错误的同时，仍保持高带宽的 CPU，且使用 LPDDR5X 内存。
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.52,1:01:47.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera achieves 40% lower peak memory latency versus X86, keeping cores fed on time through retrieval, analytics, and sandbox execution.\N与 X86 相比，Vera 的峰值内存延迟降低 40%，\N在数据检索、分析和沙箱执行中确保核心及时供能。
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.48,1:01:58.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia's second-generation scalable coherency fabric unifies all 88 Olympus cores on a monolithic mesh with separate dies for memory and IO.\N英伟达第二代可扩展一致性架构，将全部 88 个奥利匹斯\N核心集成在单片网格上，并为内存和 I/O 单独设置芯片。
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.08,1:02:06.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cores are not split across chiplets, enabling 50% faster core-to-core communication than traditional CPUs.\N核心未跨芯片小片分布，相比传统 CPU，核心间通信速度提升 50%。
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.56,1:02:12.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And memory coherent NVLink chip-to-chip connects GPUs directly to the fabric.\N内存一致的 NVLink 芯片间连接，使 GPU 可直接接入该架构。
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.52,1:02:21.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Beyond GPUs, NVLink chip-to-chip can scale Vera up to multiple sockets, enabling massive bandwidth between CPUs.\N除 GPU 外，NVLink 芯片间连接还可将 Vera 扩展至多个插槽，实现 CPU 间超大带宽。
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.80,1:02:27.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera delivers 1.8 times the agentic sandbox performance of X86 CPUs.\NVera 的代理式沙箱性能是 X86 CPU 的 1.8 倍。
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.00,1:02:34.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Standalone Vera racks run agent sandboxes, tools, code, and data pipelines.\N独立的 Vera 机架可运行智能体沙箱、工具、代码和数据流水线。
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.20,1:02:39.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tightly coupled to Rubin GPUs, Vera keeps accelerated workflows moving.\N与 Rubin GPU 紧密耦合，Vera 保持加速工作流持续运行。
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.60,1:02:46.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia Vera BlueField 4 STS powers context memory and AI storage.\N英伟达 Vera BlueField 4 STS 为上下文内存和 AI 存储提供动力。
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.44,1:02:49.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Compute, networking, storage.\N计算、网络、存储。
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.76,1:03:00.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera is the CPU for the age of agents.\NVera 是智能体时代的 CPU。
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.96,1:03:03.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is going to be our new major growth driver.\N这将成为我们新的主要增长引擎。
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.94,1:03:09.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The reviews are already coming out and it's pretty good.\N评价已经出炉，反响相当不错。
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.00,1:03:18.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's pretty good stuff.\N这确实是一流的产品。
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.72,1:03:22.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, remember,\N现在，请记住，
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.12,1:03:32.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grace and Vera are also the most highly qualified CPUs in the world of AI because every single data center,\NGrace 和 Vera 也是 AI 领域中资格最顶尖的 CPU，因为每一个数据中心，
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.32,1:03:41.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,every single cloud, every single enterprise, every company that works with NVIDIA on AI has already qualified Grace.\N每一个云服务，每一个企业，每一个与英伟达合作 AI 的公司，都已经完成了 Grace 的认证。
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.39,1:03:45.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,The entire software stack has already been optimized for Grace.\N整个软件栈已经针对 Grace 完成了优化。
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.70,1:03:49.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every company will be qualifying Vera.\N每一家公司都将在未来认证 Vera。
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.36,1:03:53.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera will be the most optimized agentic CPU in the world.\NVera 将成为全球最优化的代理式 CPU。
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.68,1:03:56.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Simply because it's going to go with Vera Rubin.\N只是因为它将与维拉·鲁宾一起推出。
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.96,1:04:00.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Simply because we made the the big hard switch.\N只是因为我们完成了那个重大而艰难的切换。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.68,1:04:10.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, during Grace Blackwell transition, the biggest risk was going from external CPU x86 into Grace Blackwell.\N事实上，在格蕾丝·布莱克威尔过渡期间，最大的风险是从外部 x86 CPU 转向格蕾丝·布莱克威尔。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.24,1:04:13.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,That transition was extremely dangerous.\N这次过渡极其危险。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.52,1:04:16.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we did it with incredible execution.\N但我们以惊人的执行力完成了它。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.64,1:04:21.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now Grace is literally synonymous with Grace Blackwell.\N如今，格蕾丝几乎等同于格蕾丝·布莱克威尔。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.44,1:04:24.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,When people say Blackwell, they say Grace Blackwell.\N当人们提到布莱克威尔时，他们说的就是格蕾丝·布莱克威尔。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.20,1:04:26.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because it is utterly now everywhere.\N因为它现在无处不在。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.60,1:04:29.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every company's software stack has been optimized for it.\N每家公司的软件栈都已针对它进行了优化。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.76,1:04:32.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everybody's security stack has been optimized for it.\N每家公司的安全栈也都已针对它进行了优化。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.74,1:04:34.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now here comes Vera.\N现在维拉·鲁宾来了。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.68,1:04:36.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm super excited about that.\N我对此非常激动。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.06,1:04:39.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now look at some of the performance numbers.\N现在来看一些性能数据。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.12,1:04:40.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Speed-ups is one thing.\N提升速度是一回事。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.04,1:04:45.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is extremely hard to speed up SQL.\N极难提升 SQL 的速度。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.76,1:04:55.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,SQL the most famous domain-specific language DSL that has ever been created.\NSQL 是迄今为止最著名的领域专用语言。
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.60,1:05:00.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Before SQL you know, before CUDA, there was SQL.\N在 SQL 之前，你知道的，在 CUDA 之前，就有 SQL。
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.16,1:05:02.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Before OpenGL, there was SQL.\N在 OpenGL 之前，就有 SQL。
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.88,1:05:05.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Invented by IBM.\N由 IBM 发明。
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.12,1:05:08.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, it is the structured database engine of the planet.\N如今，它是全球的结构化数据库引擎。
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.51,1:05:10.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everybody uses SQL.\N每个人都在使用 SQL。
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.60,1:05:14.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is SQL running three times faster.\N这是 SQL 运行速度提升了三倍。
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.60,1:05:21.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not 10% faster, not 25% faster, 10 times faster three times faster.\N不是快 10%，也不是快 25%，而是快了十倍，三倍。
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.15,1:05:22.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Incredible.\N难以置信。
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.16,1:05:28.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is real-time the next one is real-time stream processing.\N这是实时处理，下一个也是实时流处理。
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.24,1:05:32.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Remember, your AI is going to be not just reading documents.\N记住，你的AI将不仅限于阅读文档。
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.02,1:05:40.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your AI is going to be watching for telemetry, especially inside a factory, inside a stock exchange.\N你的AI将实时监控遥测数据，尤其是在工厂或证券交易所内部。
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.04,1:05:44.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're going to be looking for telemetry continuously.\N你将需要持续监控遥测数据。
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.20,1:05:48.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The burst of data that's coming in goes into a CPU.\N突发的数据流入CPU。
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.48,1:05:54.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Vera CPU running real-time stream processing for New York Stock Exchange.\N这是Vera CPU，为纽约证券交易所提供实时流处理。
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.66,1:06:00.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lynn Martin, the president of New York Stock Exchange, has been so gracious to partner with us.\N纽约证券交易所总裁林恩·马丁非常慷慨地与我们合作。
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.48,1:06:05.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,This system is run all over the world in real-time real-time stream processing.\N该系统在全球范围内实时运行，进行实时流处理。
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.72,1:06:13.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera CPU six times all because of the bandwidth the single single-threaded instruction execution,\NVera CPU的性能提升了六倍，完全得益于带宽，\N无论是单线程指令执行、核心间的带宽，还是核心外的带宽。
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.58,1:06:17.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,the bandwidth inside between the cores, the bandwidth outside.\NVera CPU的带宽在核心内部和外部都极为出色。
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.80,1:06:20.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera is completely revolutionary.\NVera是彻底革命性的。
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.92,1:06:28.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's Vera.\N这就是Vera。
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.68,1:06:32.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, X factors is something you you talk about when you're talking about GPUs.\N你知道，X 因素是人们在谈论 GPU 时才会提到的东西。
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.55,1:06:41.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is quite rare that somebody talks about X factors on real workload real workload that is associated with CPUs.\N很少有人会谈到与 CPU 相关的真实工作负载中的 X 因素。
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.73,1:06:43.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, I'm so proud of the team.\N所以，我为团队感到无比自豪。
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.14,1:06:44.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,You guys did such a great job.\N你们做得太出色了。
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.51,1:06:48.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have an extraordinary road map coming.\N我们即将推出一个非凡的产品路线图。
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.16,1:06:54.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, what's really exciting is almost everybody is supporting Vera.\N但真正令人兴奋的是，几乎所有人都在支持 Vera。
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.44,1:06:56.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're as excited as we are.\N他们的激动程度和我们一样。
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.11,1:07:02.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Vera opening up it's opened up a brand new market.\N这是 Vera 的开启，它已经打开了一片全新的市场。
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.52,1:07:06.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agents agents is a new workload.\N智能体是一种全新的工作负载。
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.40,1:07:09.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,We built CPUs for humans in the past.\N过去，我们为人类打造了 CPU。
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.40,1:07:13.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,We need CPUs for agents, agentic systems.\N现在，我们需要为智能体和代理式系统打造 CPU。
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.76,1:07:14.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Their properties are different.\N它们的特性是不同的。
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.93,1:07:17.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why would the old CPUs be the same?\N为什么旧的CPU会一样呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.80,1:07:22.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are building millions and millions of errors.\N我们正在制造数以百万计的错误。
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.76,1:07:24.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Millions of errors.\N数以百万计的错误。
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.22,1:07:34.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,And to go to market with us, Taiwan's ODMs and computer makers, all the OEMs, and you could see the early adopters.\N要与我们一同进入市场，台湾的ODM厂商和电脑制造商，所有OEM厂商，以及早期采用者都已显现。
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.80,1:07:38.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,The early adopters are the agentic companies.\N早期采用者是那些代理式公司。
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.44,1:07:44.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the beginning of a new market, a market that never existed before.\N这是一个新市场的开端，一个以前从未存在过的市场。
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.12,1:07:49.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not going to take away from the old markets, but this is a new market.\N它不会取代旧市场，但这是一个全新的市场。
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.08,1:07:51.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,CPU for agents.\N为智能体而生的CPU。
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.64,1:07:55.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this will this this market will surely be larger than the last.\N这个市场肯定会比上一个更大。
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.94,1:08:00.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is because there'll be a lot more agents than there are people.\N原因在于，智能体的数量将远超人类。
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.20,1:08:03.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then there'll the agents are very impatient.\N而且这些智能体非常急躁。
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.50,1:08:09.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, Nvidia Vera CPU.\N所以，英伟达Vera CPU。
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.09,1:08:13.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.68,1:08:15.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the most important slide, really.\N这是最重要的一页幻灯片，真的。
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.94,1:08:17.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the takeaway.\N这就是核心要点。
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.88,1:08:21.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The takeaway here is that this is the application pattern.\N这里的核心要点是，这就是应用模式。
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.20,1:08:26.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the computing pattern of the next decade.\N这是未来十年的计算模式。
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.36,1:08:33.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agents, harnesses, orchestrating large language models.\N智能体、运行框架，协同大型语言模型。
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.20,1:08:35.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every company will run it.\N每家公司都会运行它。
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.96,1:08:39.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every company will be an agent company.\N每家公司都会成为智能体公司。
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.40,1:08:42.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every company will have agents running inside.\N每家公司都会在内部运行智能体。
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.88,1:08:49.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every company will see that agents will need its own operating system.\N每家公司都会意识到，智能体需要自己的操作系统。
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.92,1:08:54.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every company's asking us, "How do we run agents safely?\N每家公司都在问我们：“我们如何安全地运行智能体？”
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.30,1:08:58.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,How do we build agents for our own workloads?"\N我们该如何为自己的工作负载构建智能体？”
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.78,1:09:04.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, we have the Nvidia agent toolkit for enterprise AI.\N因此，我们推出了英伟达面向企业AI的智能体工具套件。
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.96,1:09:08.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,You've seen me build this in plain sight.\N你们已经看到我公开构建这个项目的过程。
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.16,1:09:16.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Almost everything that NVIDIA does, as you know, at every GTC, if you go back and look at my GTC 5 years ago or 10 years ago, you will see today.\N正如你们所知，英伟达在每届GTC上所做的几乎一切，\N如果你回看我五年前或十年前的GTC演讲，就会发现今天的一切都已初现端倪。
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.56,1:09:23.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,This you've seen me talking about for several years now because we've been building for this moment.\N这个话题我已经谈了好几年，因为我们一直在为这一刻做准备。
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.64,1:09:32.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are four things that companies need in order to build agents as a service or build agents to operate.\N企业要构建作为服务的智能体，或构建可运行的智能体，需要四个要素。
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.76,1:09:35.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first thing you need is you need models.\N首先，你需要模型。
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.72,1:09:42.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course, large language models, the smarter the better, the cheaper the better, the faster the better.\N当然，大语言模型，越聪明越好，越便宜越好，越快越好。
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.48,1:09:47.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second is you need a harness to orchestrate the whole thing.\N第二，你需要一个运行框架来协调整个系统。
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.68,1:09:52.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The third, these eight these models want to use tools.\N第三，这些模型需要使用工具。
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.40,1:09:54.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And these tools come with it skills.\N而这些工具自带各种能力。
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.96,1:10:01.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I showed you CUDA X libraries, those are going to be amazing tools for the agents in the future.\N我向你们展示了CUDA-X库，这些将成为未来智能体的惊人工具。
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.52,1:10:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then lastly, you need a runtime.\N最后，你还需要一个运行时环境。
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.76,1:10:08.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need the operating system that holds it all together.\N你需要一个能将所有部分整合在一起的操作系统。
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.28,1:10:12.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the NVIDIA toolkit for agents.\N这是英伟达为智能体提供的工具包。
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.44,1:10:18.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,It includes it includes models that you can modify.\N它包含你可以修改的模型。
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.95,1:10:22.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA's world-class open models, I want to show you more.\N英伟达世界级的开源模型，我想向你们展示更多。
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.64,1:10:25.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can run agents from anybody.\N你可以运行任何人的智能体。
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.03,1:10:31.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,You could run uh Claude code, incredible agent, Codex, incredible agent.\N你可以运行 Claude Code、令人惊叹的智能体，或 Codex、令人惊叹的智能体。
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.31,1:10:38.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,You could run it inside this harness called OpenShell, which will be highly secure for your inside the enterprise.\N你可以将其运行在这个名为 OpenShell 的运行框架中，它将为你的企业内部提供高度安全的环境。
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.92,1:10:46.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The shell protects the agent, keeps it grounded in security policies.\N这个外壳保护智能体，使其始终遵循安全策略。
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.68,1:10:48.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Privacy is protected.\N隐私得到保护。
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.76,1:10:51.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Its rights and privileges are given.\N智能体的权限和特权被授予。
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.32,1:10:53.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Its identity is protected.\N智能体的身份得到保护。
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.43,1:10:57.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, this OpenShell is being adopted all over the world.\N因此，OpenShell 正在全球范围内被广泛采用。
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.33,1:10:59.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA OpenShell is open source.\N英伟达 OpenShell 是开源的。
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.00,1:11:02.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're going to see so many companies adopt it.\N你会看到众多公司采用它。
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.41,1:11:07.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Red Hat, Canonical, Microsoft, it's going to be adopted everywhere.\N红帽、Canonical、微软，它将被广泛采用。
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.56,1:11:10.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is an important This is the runtime.\N这很重要，这是运行时环境。
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.96,1:11:16.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this runtime is fully optimized for the NVIDIA AI platform.\N这个运行时环境完全针对英伟达 AI 平台进行了优化。
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.40,1:11:17.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which is everywhere.\N而英伟达 AI 平台无处不在。
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.60,1:11:24.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, you can run OpenShell in any cloud, on prem, and even on device.\N因此，你可以在任何云、本地或设备上运行 OpenShell。
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.56,1:11:29.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, you have you have now tools and libraries that they can use.\N现在你有了可以使用的工具和库。
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.88,1:11:33.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have models that you can modify or use as is.\N你有了可以修改或直接使用的模型。
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.34,1:11:35.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or you have agents.\N或者你有了智能体。
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.40,1:11:42.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is OpenClaw, Hermes, another incredible another incredible harness.\N这是 OpenClaw，赫尔墨斯，另一个令人惊叹的智能体运行框架。
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.78,1:11:48.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,These agent agentic harnesses can now run on prem or for you anywhere.\N这些代理式智能体运行框架现在可以在本地或任何地方运行。
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.48,1:11:49.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?\N好的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.27,1:11:55.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, four things and this represents the operating system of the modern enterprise.\N所以，四件事，这代表了现代企业的操作系统。
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.44,1:11:57.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, how do we use this?\N那么我们该如何使用它？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.72,1:12:03.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,One of my favorite use cases of agents is chip designers.\N我最喜欢的智能体应用场景之一是芯片设计。
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.52,1:12:07.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is the single most important thing that NVIDIA does.\N这是英伟达所做的最重要的一件事。
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.44,1:12:13.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, of course, we have to partner with Cadence to build super agent.\N因此，我们当然要与楷登电子合作，打造超级智能体。
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.36,1:12:16.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,A chip design super agent.\N一款芯片设计超级智能体。
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.36,1:12:21.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is orchestrated by Codex or Claude Code.\N它由 Codex 或 Claude Code 协调。
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.60,1:12:30.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has RTL and architecture diagrams or schematics or uh specifications as input and whatever you need to fix.\N它以 RTL 代码和架构图、电路图或规格说明作为输入，以及你需要修复的任何内容。
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.52,1:12:41.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And together, we created some super agents that are optimized for the NVIDIA runtime with Nemotron.\N我们共同打造了一些针对英伟达运行时优化的超级智能体，使用的是 Nemotron。
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.20,1:12:41.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And let's take a look.\N我们来看一下。
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.04,1:12:46.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's really incredible.\N真是令人难以置信。
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.44,1:12:51.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cadence and NVIDIA are partnering to build chip design agents.\N楷登电子与英伟达正在合作开发芯片设计智能体。
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.52,1:12:59.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hundreds of thousands of NVIDIA chips come together to make the AI factories that power the world's frontier AI models.\N数十万片英伟达芯片汇聚在一起，构成了驱动全球前沿AI模型的AI工厂。
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.20,1:13:04.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Designing these chips and the systems they run in is one of the hardest engineering challenges.\N设计这些芯片及其运行系统，是工程领域最艰巨的挑战之一。
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.04,1:13:09.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Trillions of transistors, three-dimensional circuits, microscopic scale.\N万亿级晶体管，三维电路，微观尺度。
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.01,1:13:18.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every gate, every wire synchronized to picoseconds must work in perfect harmony with no margin for error.\N每个门电路、每根导线都必须在皮秒级精度下同步运行，彼此完美协同，容不得丝毫差错。
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.64,1:13:21.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Physical prototypes are too slow and too costly.\N物理原型制作过于缓慢且成本高昂。
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.34,1:13:24.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, engineers work in the digital realm.\N因此，工程师们在数字世界中工作。
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.20,1:13:32.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each chip begins as a set of architectural specifications, then translated into RTL, the language of chip design.\N每颗芯片最初都是一组架构规格，随后被转换为RTL，即芯片设计的语言。
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.20,1:13:34.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,RTL must be verified in simulation.\NRTL必须在仿真中进行验证。
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.76,1:13:37.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,A single bug can delay a chip by months.\N一个微小的漏洞就可能导致芯片研发延迟数月。
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.60,1:13:45.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,At NVIDIA, thousands of engineers, billions of computer hours per year, millions of tests written, run, and debugged.\N在英伟达，数千名工程师，每年数十亿计算机运行小时，数百万次测试被编写、运行并调试。
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.36,1:13:47.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,A cycle that takes teams weeks.\N这一循环需要团队花费数周时间。
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.92,1:13:53.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,To compress this cycle, Cadence and NVIDIA built a design verification agent.\N为了压缩这一流程，楷登电子与英伟达共同打造了设计验证智能体。
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.12,1:13:55.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Codex orchestrates the process.\NCodex 协调整个流程。
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.28,1:13:59.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cadence ChipStack launches the RTL verification loop.\N楷登 ChipStack 启动了 RTL 验证循环。
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.28,1:14:03.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Powered by Nemotron and secured by NVIDIA OpenShell.\N由 Nemotron 提供算力支持，并由英伟达 OpenShell 保障安全。
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.28,1:14:10.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Calling on expert sub-agents in RTL generation, test bench creation, regression testing, and debug.\N调用 RTL 生成、测试平台创建、回归测试和调试等领域的专家子智能体。
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.04,1:14:13.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,The system drives itself.\N系统实现了自我驱动。
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.08,1:14:19.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The ChipStack agents run hundreds of simulations with Cadence Xcelium, formal verification with Jasper.\NChipStack 智能体在楷登 Xcelium 上运行数百次仿真，\N并使用 Jasper 进行形式化验证。
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.68,1:14:21.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Design flaws revealed.\N设计缺陷被揭示出来。
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.34,1:14:23.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bugs in the code fixed.\N代码中的漏洞得以修复。
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.96,1:14:26.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,What once took weeks now takes hours.\N曾需数周的工作现在只需数小时。
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.68,1:14:30.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Verification cycles over 40 times faster.\N验证周期速度提升超过 40 倍。
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.80,1:14:38.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Together, NVIDIA and Cadence are reinventing chip design with AI agents.\N英伟达与楷登电子正携手通过 AI 智能体重新定义芯片设计。
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.32,1:14:41.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,From weeks from weeks to hours.\N从数周缩短到数小时。
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.76,1:14:43.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,From weeks to hours.\N从数周缩短到数小时。
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.25,1:14:44.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,From weeks to hours.\N从数周缩短到数小时。
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.65,1:14:47.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA has thousands of chip designers.\N英伟达拥有数千名芯片设计师。
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.23,1:14:53.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are going to hire hundreds of thousands of Cadence super agents that work with\N我们将招聘数十万名与我们协作的楷登超级智能体，
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.70,1:14:59.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,us so that we can accelerate our company so that we can be even more ambitious,\N以加速公司发展，使我们能更加雄心勃勃，
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.14,1:15:02.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,create even more amazing things, run even faster.\N创造更多令人惊叹的成果，运行得更快。
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.48,1:15:10.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,You saw earlier that the toolkit with models harness tools\N你之前看到过，这个工具包能调用模型来使用工具，
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.68,1:15:14.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,The tools in this case are Cadence simulators and verifiers,\N这里的工具是楷登的仿真器和验证器，
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.49,1:15:16.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,formal verification systems.\N以及形式化验证系统。
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.05,1:15:24.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is the reason why we're working with Cadence so hard to accelerate all of their tools on CUDA because the agents are impatient.\N这正是我们如此努力与楷登合作，将他们所有工具加速运行在 CUDA 上的原因，因为这些智能体很急躁。
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.92,1:15:27.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The agents want the answer immediately.\N智能体希望立即得到答案。
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.92,1:15:37.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so models harnesses accelerated CUDA accelerated libraries and tools and then the runtime.\N因此，这些模型利用了加速的 CUDA 加速库和工具，以及运行时环境。
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.88,1:15:41.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,What you saw just now is all of that coming together.\N你们刚才看到的，就是所有这些技术的融合。
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.80,1:15:51.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, one of the things that it starts with is a great model that Cadence could modify and tune to be expert at the Cadence workflow,\N它开始于一个出色的模型，Cadence 可以对其进行修改和调优，\N使其精通 Cadence 的工作流程。
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.52,1:16:02.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,at the Cadence expertise so that they could create super agents that are proprietary to Cadence with their proprietary knowledge.\N从而在 Cadence 的专有知识基础上，创建出仅属于 Cadence 的超级智能体。
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.20,1:16:04.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,They have to start with an excellent model.\N他们必须从一个卓越的模型开始。
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.19,1:16:05.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,We call it Nemotron.\N我们称之为 Nemotron。
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.04,1:16:14.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia is dedicated to build open models for the world so that all of you, all of us could create our own agents.\N英伟达致力于为世界打造开源模型，让你们所有人、我们所有人，都能创建属于自己的智能体。
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.56,1:16:22.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today we're announcing the Nemotron 3 Ultra.\N今天，我们宣布推出 Nemotron 3 Ultra。
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.16,1:16:24.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yep, our next open model.\N没错，这是我们下一个开源模型。
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.56,1:16:30.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it is smart.\N它非常智能。
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.88,1:16:39.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Nemotron models not only give you the model we give you all the data that we used to train the model.\NNemotron 模型不仅提供模型本身，还提供我们用于训练该模型的所有数据。
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.56,1:16:45.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And because we have a coalition of incredible partners, you can see all of our partners down here.\N由于我们拥有众多杰出的合作伙伴，你们可以看到下方列出的所有合作伙伴。
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.00,1:16:50.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,We work together, contribute data to each other.\N我们通力合作，互相贡献数据。
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.52,1:16:56.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nemotron is trained on one of the largest suites of long-running reasoning models,\NNemotron 基于全球最大的长期推理模型系列进行训练，
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.42,1:17:02.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,long-running tool task solving, tool using data sets in the world.\N包括全球最长时序的工具任务求解与工具使用数据集。
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.84,1:17:13.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because of all of our great partnerships, all of this from the model, the training script, and the data made all completely available to you.\N凭借我们众多出色的合作关系，所有这些——从模型、训练脚本到数据——都完全向您开放。
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.59,1:17:16.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is open models at its best.\N这就是开源模型的巅峰之作。
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.76,1:17:20.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The best open model system policies in the world.\N全球最优秀的开源模型系统政策。
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.68,1:17:27.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Simple goal is so that you can take all of it, add to it, make it even better, make it yours.\N简单目标就是让您能获取全部内容，加以扩展，让它变得更好，变成您自己的。
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.32,1:17:33.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nemotron 3 Ultra is five times faster.\NNemotron 3 Ultra 的速度提升了五倍。
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.48,1:17:42.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the world's first model based on a hybrid architecture of SSM, state space models, with mixture of experts.\N这是全球首个基于 SSM（状态空间模型）与专家混合架构的模型。
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.00,1:17:45.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,The architecture is incredibly fast.\N该架构极其快速。
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.53,1:17:48.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,We made it faster that you could think fast.\N我们让它快到让您觉得思考都变得飞快。
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.07,1:17:51.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you think fast, you could think longer at the same cost.\N当您思考得更快时，相同成本下就能思考得更久。
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.96,1:17:54.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, five times faster.\N所以，速度快了五倍。
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.80,1:18:06.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is also 30% cheaper, 30% lower cost to run in total flops, in total inference time, than even the most cost-effective in the world.\N它的总计算量和总推理时间成本也低了30%，比世界上任何最经济的模型都要便宜。
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.56,1:18:09.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're comparing against the world's best open models.\N我们正在与全球最佳的开源模型进行对比。
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.00,1:18:12.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Frontier smart.\N前沿智能。
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.36,1:18:14.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Five times faster.\N快五倍。
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.52,1:18:16.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,30 point 30% cheaper.\N便宜了30.3%。
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.00,1:18:19.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Completely open.\N完全开源。
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.12,1:18:20.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're completely dedicated to this.\N我们完全致力于此。
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.98,1:18:22.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is now Nemotron 3.\N现在这就是Nemotron 3。
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.50,1:18:25.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're currently working on Nemotron 4.\N我们目前正在开发Nemotron 4。
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.96,1:18:33.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, this entire toolkit from models, harnesses, tools and skills,\N因此，从模型、运行框架、工具和技能，
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.60,1:18:39.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,and runtimes is the reason why every enterprise company in the world has the\N到运行时环境，这一整套工具包正是全球每一家企业公司都选择它的原因。
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.64,1:18:45.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,ability now to create their own agents just like Cadence did with their super agents.\N现在人们可以像楷登电子那样，创建属于自己的智能体。
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.59,1:18:52.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we're working with so many companies, Cadence and CrowdStrike and Dassault and Palantir, SAP and ServiceNow.\N我们正与众多公司合作，包括楷登电子、CrowdStrike、达索系统、\N帕兰提尔、SAP和ServiceNow。
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.47,1:18:58.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,People were always said, "Jensen, the agents are going to disrupt these markets."\N人们总是说：“黄仁勋，智能体将颠覆这些市场。”
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.80,1:19:02.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I said completely opposite and you can now see it.\N我却持完全相反的观点，现在你们已经看到了。
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.17,1:19:08.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agents is going to create the largest opportunity ever for my partners and friends.\N智能体将为我的合作伙伴和朋友们创造有史以来最大的机遇。
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.14,1:19:16.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we have the Nemo the the NVIDIA agentic toolkit for enterprise AI to help them.\N我们推出了NVIDIA企业AI智能体工具包，帮助他们实现这一目标。
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.96,1:19:23.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, there you go.\N所以，就是这样。
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.60,1:19:27.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,First, Vera Rubin in full production.\N首先，Vera Rubin已全面投入生产。
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.12,1:19:32.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Two, Vera CPU, CPU built for a new generation for agents.\N其次，Vera CPU，专为新一代智能体打造的CPU。
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.93,1:19:34.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And three,\N第三，
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.16,1:19:39.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA's enterprise AI toolkits so that every enterprise\N英伟达的企业AI工具包，让每个企业
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.62,1:19:44.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,and every enterprise software\N和每款企业软件
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.14,1:19:53.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,company can build agents.\N公司可以构建智能体。
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.68,1:19:58.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,My relationship with you started here.\N我与你的关系就从这里开始。
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.52,1:20:07.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And many of you, many of you, many of my friends and partners here in Taiwan, your companies started here.\N在座的许多人，许多我的朋友和合作伙伴，你们的公司也都是从这里起步的。
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.20,1:20:14.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is in a lot of ways the beginning of the modern computer industry, 40 years now.\N从很多方面来看，这正是现代计算机产业的开端，至今已有40年。
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.44,1:20:16.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA's 33 years old.\N英伟达成立33年了。
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.68,1:20:27.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,The PC industry was already starting to get to Windows 1 and Windows 2 and Apple Apple 1 and Apple 2 and by the time that we came along,\N个人电脑产业当时已开始发展，Windows 1和Windows 2、\NApple 1和Apple 2相继问世，而我们那时才加入。
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.88,1:20:31.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Windows 3.1 was the PC.\NWindows 3.1就是当时的个人电脑标准。
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.36,1:20:36.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And as you know, Windows 95 made PC personal.\N正如你们所知，Windows 95让个人电脑真正变得个人化。
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.20,1:20:43.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,It took PC from enterprises, com- companies, and made it into a consumer electronics device.\N它将个人电脑从企业级设备转变为消费电子产品。
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.68,1:20:46.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everybody should have one, and everybody does.\N每个人都应该拥有一台，而如今每个人确实都有。
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.68,1:20:48.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the beginning.\N这是起点。
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.32,1:20:53.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This computing platform did several things incredibly smart.\N这个计算平台做了几件非常聪明的事。
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.40,1:20:56.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Windows was not just disaggregated, as you know.\NWindows 不仅实现了去耦合，这一点你很清楚。
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.64,1:20:59.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Windows was properly abstracted.\NWindows 实现了恰当的抽象。
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.25,1:21:01.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was architected just right.\N它的架构设计得恰到好处。
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.68,1:21:10.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Systems BIOSes, open chipsets, the operating system with drivers,\N系统 BIOS、开放的芯片组，以及带有驱动程序的操作系统，
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.80,1:21:15.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,drivers that could be connected and installed at runtime.\N驱动程序可以在运行时连接和安装。
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.20,1:21:25.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And an abstraction layer with a multimedia API that was that opened up the PC to what we all know today.\N还有一个多媒体 API 抽象层，它让个人电脑向我们今天所熟知的样子敞开了大门。
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.64,1:21:31.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each one of these elements were essential in making the PC so popular.\N这些元素中的每一个，都是让个人电脑如此流行的关键。
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.00,1:21:39.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,40 years later, Microsoft and Nvidia are going to reinvent the PC.\N40 年后，微软和英伟达将重新定义个人电脑。
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.72,1:21:42.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is going to be the new PC.\N这将是新一代的个人电脑。
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.88,1:21:48.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, tomorrow night, tomorrow night, I think it's tomorrow night our time, but I'm going to be with Satya.\N现在，明天晚上，明天晚上，我想是明天晚上我们的时区，但我将和萨蒂亚在一起。
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.87,1:21:53.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to talk a lot more about the work that we're doing together.\N我们将深入探讨我们合作开展的工作。
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.12,1:21:56.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Microsoft and Nvidia, over the last 3 years,\N微软和英伟达在过去三年里，
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.48,1:22:04.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,it took this long to completely reinvent how the PC's going to work, so that we could be ready for this moment.\N重新设计个人电脑的工作方式花了这么长时间，就是为了让我们能准备好迎接这一刻。
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.08,1:22:11.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,As I mentioned earlier, that compute pattern called the agent is going to run in AI clouds.\N正如我之前提到的，这种称为智能体的计算模式将在AI云中运行。
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.60,1:22:14.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's going to run inside enterprises.\N它将在企业内部运行。
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.52,1:22:18.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is also going to run on your PC.\N它也将运行在你的个人电脑上。
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.44,1:22:22.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen to that PC when it has an autonomous agent?\N当个人电脑拥有了自主智能体后，会发生什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.76,1:22:26.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,An agent that's helping you, that understands you.\N一个能帮助你、理解你的智能体。
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.24,1:22:27.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,You could talk to it.\N你可以和它对话。
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.16,1:22:28.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,It could look at you.\N它可以看着你。
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.69,1:22:35.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,You could ask it to refile those, go help you do some research.\N你可以让它重新整理那些文件，帮你做些研究。
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.28,1:22:37.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,It could do a lot more that I'll show you.\N它还能做更多我将向你展示的事情。
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.64,1:22:45.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the new operating system is of course the old operating system plus large language models.\N但新的操作系统当然是旧的操作系统加上大型语言模型。
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.48,1:22:51.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Large language models in a lot of ways is the modern version of DirectX.\N大型语言模型在很多方面，相当于现代版的DirectX。
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.44,1:22:59.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has of course input and output, understands prompts, it understands computer vision, it can generate video, it can generate sounds.\N它当然具备输入和输出功能，能理解提示词，能处理计算机视觉，能生成视频，也能生成声音。
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.44,1:23:07.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is the modern extension, the intelligence extension of the PC, of a computer.\N它是个人电脑、计算机的现代智能延伸。
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.28,1:23:15.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,On top of that, the application, as I mentioned before, is going to be replaced by now in agentic runtime.\N在此基础上，正如我之前提到的，应用程序将被代理式运行时所取代。
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.44,1:23:19.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that is the modern application and agent.\N这就是现代的应用程序和智能体。
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.28,1:23:23.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's now take a look at what it can do.\N现在让我们来看看它能做什么。
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.36,1:23:26.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,It started with a spark.\N它始于一个火花。
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.12,1:23:34.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,An idea to reimagine the PC for the first time in 40 years with the age of AI.\N一个重新构想个人电脑的念头，这是40年来首次在人工智能时代进行。
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.84,1:23:39.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,What becomes of our personal computer in a world of agents?\N在智能体的世界里，我们的个人电脑会变成什么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.64,1:23:44.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agents running natively, connected to models, local or in the cloud.\N智能体原生运行，连接模型，本地或在云端。
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.91,1:23:52.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our personal AI, sandboxed for security, running continuously, getting work done.\N我们的个人AI，被沙箱隔离以保障安全，持续运行，高效完成任务。
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.48,1:23:56.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,The chips and the OS must evolve.\N芯片和操作系统必须随之进化。
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.56,1:23:59.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Introducing RTX Spark.\N首次亮相：RTX Spark。
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.88,1:24:05.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything we've learned over 33 years distilled into one chip.\N33年来我们所积累的所有知识，浓缩于一颗芯片之中。
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.88,1:24:14.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Blackwell RTX GPU with 6,144 CUDA cores, 1 petaflop of AI performance,\N搭载6144个CUDA核心、1 petaflop AI性能的Blackwell RTX GPU，
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.72,1:24:23.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,a custom 20-core Grace CPU built in partnership with MediaTek, fused by NVLink.\N一颗与联发科合作打造的定制20核Grace CPU，通过NVLink实现融合。
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.08,1:24:26.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,128 GB of unified memory.\N128 GB统一内存。
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.89,1:24:29.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,TSMC 3-nanometer process.\N台积电3纳米制程。
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.92,1:24:33.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,70 billion transistors.\N700亿个晶体管。
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.84,1:24:39.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in close collaboration with Microsoft, a Windows platform for agents.\N并与微软紧密合作，打造面向智能体的Windows平台。
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.04,1:24:44.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're reinventing the personal computer.\N我们正在重新定义个人电脑。
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.12,1:24:46.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,For creating.\N用于创造。
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.88,1:24:49.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,For gaming.\N用于游戏。
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.96,1:24:51.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,For agents.\N用于智能体。
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.72,1:24:55.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the dawn of a new personal computing revolution.\N这是个人计算新革命的黎明。
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.04,1:24:57.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it starts\N而这一切始于
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.33,1:24:58.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,with NVIDIA\N英伟达
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.43,1:24:58.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,RTX\NRTX
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.80,1:25:14.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Spark.\N星火。
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.32,1:25:16.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here it is.\N就在这里。
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.88,1:25:22.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course, I got to show you the most beautiful part, which is video games.\N当然，我得向你们展示最精彩的部分，那就是电子游戏。
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.08,1:25:24.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is It's also the closest to our heart.\N它也最贴近我们的心。
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.96,1:25:26.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Forza.\N这是极限竞速。
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.60,1:25:29.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is 007, by the way.\N顺便说一下，这是007。
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.52,1:25:32.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The new 007 game, I'm looking forward to playing it.\N这款新007游戏，我非常期待能玩到。
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.64,1:25:35.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I look a little bit like him.\N我看起来有点像他。
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.28,1:25:44.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, NVIDIA's RTX Spark laptops.\N各位女士先生们，英伟达的RTX星火笔记本电脑。
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.44,1:25:51.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, thank you.\N现在，谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.76,1:25:57.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have too many things in my pocket.\N我口袋里东西太多了。
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.16,1:25:57.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.\N好的。
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.63,1:25:58.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,All right.\N好吧。
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.48,1:26:02.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the most amazing chip the world has ever built.\N这是世界上迄今为止最了不起的芯片。
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.36,1:26:07.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the N1X that we built in partnership with MediaTek.\N这是英伟达与联发科合作打造的 N1X。
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.66,1:26:09.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think I saw I saw Rick earlier.\N我刚才好像看到了瑞克。
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.83,1:26:10.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is N1X.\N这就是 N1X。
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.63,1:26:12.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a beautiful chip.\N这是一颗漂亮的芯片。
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.76,1:26:19.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is This is a a a chip that frankly would take 33 years to build.\N这颗芯片，坦白说，要花 33 年才能造出来。
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.12,1:26:25.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is because 100% of Nvidia software stack runs here.\N原因在于，英伟达的整个软件栈都能在这里运行。
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.64,1:26:28.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want to run digital biology, no problem.\N如果你想运行数字生物学，完全没问题。
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.94,1:26:31.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want to do seismic processing, no problem.\N如果你想做地震处理，完全没有问题。
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.80,1:26:33.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,You want to do astrophysics, no problem.\N你想做天体物理学研究，也完全没有问题。
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.68,1:26:40.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything associated with CUDA, all the physics, all the biology, all the genomics, all the AI, no problem.\N所有与 CUDA 相关的内容，包括所有的物理、生物、基因组学以及人工智能，都没有问题。
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.07,1:26:42.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,All the computer graphics, no problem.\N所有的计算机图形处理，都没有问题。
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.78,1:26:52.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every single application Nvidia has ever created and every single application that Windows has ever run.\N英伟达曾经创建过的每一个应用，以及 Windows 曾经运行过的每一个应用。
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.24,1:26:58.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Microsoft and Nvidia meticulously optimized everything so that this computer literally\N微软和英伟达精心优化了所有内容，使得这台计算机实际上
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.98,1:27:06.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,runs everything the world has ever created plus it now runs agents.\N能运行世界上所有已创造的内容，现在还能运行智能体。
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.25,1:27:10.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,An incredible computer.\N一台令人惊叹的计算机。
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.15,1:27:15.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud of it.\N我为此感到无比自豪。
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.40,1:27:16.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.\N好的。
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.92,1:27:22.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now I want you to keep that in mind in the next video I just I'm going to show you.\N接下来我给你看下一个视频时，请记住这一点，我马上就要展示给你看。
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.32,1:27:25.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just imagine everything here is going to run on your PC.\N只需想象这里的一切都将运行在你的电脑上。
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.57,1:27:37.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that computer could have a local Nemotron 3 ultra model or Nemotron 3 super model or it could have Claude code or Codex\N现在电脑可以本地运行一个 Nemotron 3 超级模型，\N或 Nemotron 3 极致模型，也可以运行 Claude Code 或 Codex
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.42,1:27:46.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,or some other model in the cloud or something on the network and it's going to it's going to work and do something amazing.\N或者在云端运行其他模型，或网络上的某个服务，它将开始工作，完成令人惊叹的任务。
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.48,1:27:47.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's play.\N我们来玩吧。
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.96,1:27:50.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every house starts as an idea.\N每栋房子都始于一个想法。
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.68,1:27:59.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Getting from idea to design takes a myriad of tools, expertise, and a lot of time.\N从想法到设计，需要无数工具、专业知识，以及大量时间。
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.48,1:28:05.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now an agent running locally on RTX Spark can help me design a house using the tools on\N现在，一个运行在 RTX Spark 上的智能体，可以帮我用笔记本电脑上的工具设计一栋房子
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.64,1:28:13.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,my laptop with an open shell sandbox running the Hermes harness connected to Claude Sonnet in the cloud.\N通过一个运行在开放壳沙箱中的 Hermes 运行框架，连接云端的 Claude Sonnet。
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.20,1:28:19.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I select the site, share my concept sketches and mood board of styles to inspire my design.\N我选择场地，分享我的概念草图和风格灵感板，以启发设计。
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.56,1:28:27.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the prompt, a text description of the requirements and the design intent.\N以及提示词，即对需求和设计意图的文字描述。
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.04,1:28:29.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,My agent goes to work.\N我的智能体开始工作。
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.21,1:28:38.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Using the tools on my laptop, it opens Rhino and starts modeling the site, shaping terrain, setbacks, and the building envelope.\N利用笔记本电脑上的工具，它打开 Rhino，开始建模场地，塑造地形、退线和建筑轮廓。
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.04,1:28:45.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then it proposes building forms optimized for cost, comfort, and quality.\N然后提出在成本、舒适度和质量方面优化的建筑形态。
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.76,1:28:49.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,With the form defined, my agent generates the interior layout.\N表单定义完成后，我的智能体生成了室内布局。
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.77,1:28:53.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Walls, circulation, rooms begin to take shape.\N墙体、通行路径和房间开始成形。
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.40,1:29:00.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I jump in whenever I want to adjust, to change.\N我随时可以介入调整或修改。
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.24,1:29:04.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Doors, windows, and structural elements are placed automatically.\N门、窗和结构元素自动布置。
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.67,1:29:11.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,My agent detects its own mistakes and fixes them.\N我的智能体能检测自身错误并自动修复。
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.84,1:29:16.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I approve, the agent exports the model from Rhino into Blender.\N得到我确认后，智能体将模型从 Rhino 导出至 Blender。
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.28,1:29:21.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Materials and object properties transfer with the design context intact.\N材料和对象属性在设计上下文完整保留的情况下完成转移。
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.88,1:29:25.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I fine-tune the materials, get the look just right.\N我对材料进行微调，直到效果完美。
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.48,1:29:27.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then I pick the shots.\N然后我选择镜头视角。
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.11,1:29:29.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Blender renders the house.\NBlender 渲染出整栋房屋。
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.08,1:29:34.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,My agent, using generative AI with the Flux 2 model, makes them photo real.\N我的智能体利用 Flux 2 模型的生成式 AI，使其呈现照片级真实效果。
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.05,1:29:36.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Multiple viewpoints, lighting conditions.\N多个视角、不同光照条件。
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.84,1:29:45.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,What was once a complex workflow is now guided and simplified by my agent, working with on RTX Spark.\N以往复杂的流程现在由我的智能体引导并简化，与 RTX Spark 协同工作。
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.88,1:29:55.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Design at the speed of imagination.\N以想象的速度进行设计。
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.52,1:29:58.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,PC in the world of agents.\N电脑进入智能体时代。
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.24,1:30:00.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,The developers are so excited by this.\N开发者们对此兴奋不已。
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.32,1:30:02.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is an incredible computer.\N这是一台不可思议的计算机。
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.12,1:30:11.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of the acceleration, all the software capabilities associated with it, working with every developer to make it incredible for all of you.\N所有的加速能力，以及与之相关的软件功能，都在与每位开发者协作，让这一切对你们所有人变得无比强大。
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.20,1:30:14.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The next one, Adobe.\N下一个，Adobe。
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.12,1:30:18.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Incredible tool suite, of course, used by tens of millions of people around the world.\N这套令人惊叹的工具，当然已被全球数千万人使用。
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.45,1:30:26.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,They have re-engineered the architecture, the core of Adobe Photoshop and Premiere, and they're releasing it for RTX Spark.\N他们重新设计了 Adobe Photoshop 和\NPremiere 的核心架构，并将其发布于 RTX Spark 平台。
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.68,1:30:27.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is twice as fast.\N它的速度快了两倍。
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.98,1:30:29.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's already fast.\N它本来就已经很快了。
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.16,1:30:30.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, it's going to be twice as fast.\N现在，它将快上两倍。
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.96,1:30:34.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it It's also designed to be agent-friendly.\N而且它还被设计为智能体友好型。
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.46,1:30:40.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,With its MCP server, it can now interact with agents on your laptop.\N通过其 MCP 服务器，现在它可以在你的笔记本电脑上与智能体进行交互。
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.24,1:30:49.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The number of customers, the number of partners that are so excited to bring RTX RTX Spark to the market is just incredible.\N想要将 RTX Spark 推向市场的客户和合作伙伴数量之多，令人难以置信。
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.20,1:30:56.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, this is the first across the lineup of PC reinvention for 40 years.\N你知道，这是过去 40 年来 PC 重塑历程中的首次全面革新。
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.76,1:31:02.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I'm just so happy that all of you and the ecosystem around the world has joined us.\N我非常高兴，你们所有人以及全球生态系统都加入了我们。
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.80,1:31:04.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is basically everybody.\N这基本上是所有人。
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.64,1:31:12.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everybody will RTX Spark and will be building incredibly smart and powerful and beautiful laptops with all of us.\N所有人都将使用 RTX Spark，并与我们一起打造极其智能、强大且美观的笔记本电脑。
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.78,1:31:19.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.\N非常感谢。
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.04,1:31:22.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,But that's not all.\N但这还远不止于此。
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.13,1:31:23.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's not all.\N这还远不止于此。
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.80,1:31:28.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,RTX Spark is a reinvention of laptop.\NRTX Spark 是笔记本电脑的一次重塑。
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.12,1:31:32.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,But in fact, Microsoft and Nvidia is reinventing all of PC.\N但事实上，微软和英伟达正在重塑整个 PC。
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.34,1:31:36.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And today, we're announcing a whole new line.\N今天，我们宣布推出一条全新的产品线。
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.96,1:31:44.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Three revolutionary Windows machines covering desktop, laptop, and workstations.\N三款革命性的 Windows 设备，涵盖台式机、笔记本和工作站。
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.87,1:31:52.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,All 100% Windows compatible, 100% CUDA, 100% Nvidia AI Tensor Core.\N全面兼容 Windows，100% 支持 CUDA，100% 支持英伟达 AI 张量核心。
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.32,1:31:59.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything that runs that you see that runs on Nvidia in all these different platforms around the world runs here.\N你在世界各地不同平台上运行的英伟达相关应用，现在都能在这里运行。
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.84,1:32:08.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the first completely re-engineered, reinvented line of PCs that has happened in 40 years.\N这是过去 40 年来首次完全重新设计、彻底革新的 PC 产品线。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.65,1:32:10.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, what's really amazing is this.\N真正令人惊叹的是这一点。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.26,1:32:13.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, this is This is the RTX Spark laptop.\N这是 RTX Spark 笔记本。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.96,1:32:17.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the desktop.\N这是台式机。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.48,1:32:19.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, this one's from MSI.\N这款来自微星。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.92,1:32:22.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Joseph, this one's yours.\N约瑟夫，这款是你的。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.20,1:32:22.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.\N好的。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.62,1:32:24.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look how beautiful it is.\N看看它有多美。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.41,1:32:27.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This agent could run 24/7.\N这个智能体可以全天候运行。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.76,1:32:29.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Meter-free.\N无需计量。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.60,1:32:31.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you could download your agent.\N你可以下载你的智能体。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.47,1:32:36.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,You could raise your lobster in here.\N你可以在这里养殖你的龙虾。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.56,1:32:38.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is your claw.\N这是你的钳子。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.28,1:32:40.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's running all the time.\N它一直在运行。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.24,1:32:41.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,No meter anxiety.\N无需担心计量焦虑。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.61,1:32:45.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's sitting here connected to your whole house.\N它就在这里，连接着你整个房子。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.36,1:32:47.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Connected to your laptop.\N连接你的笔记本电脑。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.52,1:32:48.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Connected to your display.\N连接你的显示器。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.00,1:32:50.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,All the cameras.\N所有摄像头。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.42,1:32:52.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your your dryer.\N你的烘干机。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.28,1:32:53.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your water cooler.\N你的饮水机。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.98,1:32:55.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your water heater.\N你的热水器。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.17,1:32:55.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your everything.\N你的所有设备。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.04,1:32:56.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whatever you want.\N任何你想要的。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.93,1:32:58.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your security system.\N你的安防系统。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.21,1:32:59.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,All connected to this.\N全部连接到这个。
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.64,1:33:02.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this becomes your personal AI.\N这就变成了你的个人 AI。
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.54,1:33:04.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your personal AI agent.\N你的个人 AI 智能体。
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.84,1:33:10.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it gets smarter and smarter and smarter over time because today we have Nemotron 3 Ultra.\N因为今天有了 Nemotron 3 Ultra，它会随着时间越来越聪明。
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.44,1:33:12.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow we have Nemotron 4.\N明天我们将拥有 Nemotron 4。
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.09,1:33:13.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then Nemotron 5.\N然后是 Nemotron 5。
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.30,1:33:13.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nemotron 6.\NNemotron 6。
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.00,1:33:17.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we just keep getting it smarter and smarter and smarter.\N而且我们不断让它变得越来越聪明。
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.16,1:33:19.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,And meanwhile, this is sitting at home helping you do things.\N同时，它就待在家中帮你完成各种任务。
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.88,1:33:22.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want to book a travel, no problem.\N如果你想订旅行，完全没问题。
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.80,1:33:34.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And if you if you want an incredible system, this is a DGX Station for Windows.\N如果你需要一个惊人的系统，这就是专为 Windows 打造的 DGX Station。
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.40,1:33:35.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Compatible with Windows.\N兼容 Windows。
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.47,1:33:37.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Runs everything in Windows.\N可在 Windows 中运行所有内容。
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.94,1:33:43.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And And it has 768 GB of memory.\N而且它拥有 768 GB 的内存。
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.00,1:33:47.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, you could run a trillion parameter model.\N所以你可以运行一个万亿参数的模型。
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.40,1:33:49.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is unbelievable.\N这简直难以置信。
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.70,1:33:51.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,20 petaflops.\N20 petaflops。
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.16,1:33:54.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,8 TB per second of memory bandwidth.\N内存带宽高达每秒 8 TB。
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.24,1:33:57.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this sits by your desk.\N它就放在你的桌边。
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.80,1:34:03.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,You basically, if you're a developer of large language models, you're a developer of agents,\N如果你是大型语言模型的开发者，那你实际上就是智能体的开发者，
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.18,1:34:10.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,having this sit by your desk gives you all the compute you need, and then when you deploy it, you put it into the cloud.\N把这个设备放在你桌边，就能获得所需的全部算力，部署时再将其放入云端。
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.26,1:34:17.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, there's something that if you look at this and think about this, something is happening here.\N现在，如果你观察这个设备并思考它，就会发现这里正在发生一些事情。
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.88,1:34:25.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Remember, 15, 20 years ago, we used to have an idea called a phone.\N记住，15到20年前，我们曾有一个叫“电话”的概念。
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.76,1:34:30.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, we have an idea called a PC.\N如今，我们有了一个叫“个人电脑”的概念。
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.28,1:34:39.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, when you think about your phone, the one thing you don't do with it is make phone calls.\N当你想到你的手机时，有一件事你不会用它来做——那就是打电话。
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.56,1:34:42.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,You do just about everything else.\N你几乎可以做其他所有事情。
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.16,1:34:48.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, that phone means something very different to you than a phone of the past.\N所以，今天的手机对你而言，意义与过去的电话完全不同。
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.00,1:34:56.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am certain what's going to happen here is that the PC 10 years from now and the PC that you think about today,\N我确信，10年后的个人电脑，以及你今天所想象的个人电脑，
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.80,1:35:06.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,a tool whether you launch applications, click and type, and this PC is going to be completely different.\N无论你是启动应用程序、点击或打字，这台电脑都将变得截然不同。
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.84,1:35:09.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here's my theory.\N这是我的理论。
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.12,1:35:18.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can totally imagine, just as every house today has a home theater, or many houses have home theaters, big TVs,\N我完全可以想象，就像如今每家都有家庭影院，或许多家庭拥有家庭影院、大电视一样，
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.80,1:35:28.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,lawnmowers, dishwashers, I could totally imagine that someday, there's actually an AI supercomputer in your house.\N割草机、洗碗机，我完全可以想象，总有一天，你家里会有一台AI超级计算机。
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.44,1:35:36.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's running all of your agents, it's running all of your assistants, and they're doing all kinds of things for you all the time.\N它在运行你所有的智能体，运行你所有的助手，它们一直在为你做各种各样的事情。
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.76,1:35:40.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you have to have it in your house, just like you have a home theater in your house,\N你必须把它放在家里，就像你家里有家庭影院一样，
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.44,1:35:44.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,you have stereos in your house, you have game consoles in your house.\N有音响系统，有游戏主机。
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.40,1:35:48.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,You would have assist AI agent computers running in your house.\N你会在家里运行辅助AI智能体计算机。
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.92,1:35:56.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And these in time becomes a lot more like R2-D2 to you.\N久而久之，它对你来说会更像R2-D2。
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.08,1:36:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,It becomes more like C-3PO to you than it feels like a PC to you.\N它对你而言更像C-3PO，而不是一台PC。
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.96,1:36:12.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,There is no question this reinvention of the computer is as big of a deal as the reinvention of the phone into what we now know as the smartphone.\N这场计算机的重新定义，其重要性不亚于手机演变为我们现在所熟知的智能手机。
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.52,1:36:14.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, this is the beginning of that journey.\N所以，这是这段旅程的开端。
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.81,1:36:17.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the beginning of a new line.\N这是一条全新产品线的起点。
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.96,1:36:19.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, we have a roadmap for this.\N因此，我们为此制定了路线图。
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.93,1:36:22.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a brand new product family for us.\N这是我们全新的产品系列。
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.04,1:36:33.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every single generation of architecture we will have a desktop, a laptop, a workstation, and then a desktop, a laptop, and workstation.\N每一代架构我们都会推出台式机、笔记本电脑、工作站，然后再推出台式机、笔记本电脑和工作站。
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.10,1:36:44.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the thing that I'm just incredibly pleased, incredibly honored is that 100% of the world's PC industry has joined us to reinvent the PC.\N令我感到无比欣喜和荣幸的是，全球 100% 的个人电脑产业都加入了我们，共同重塑个人电脑。
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.84,1:36:55.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,A new line, a new beginning.\N一条新生产线，一个新起点。
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.46,1:37:01.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.48,1:37:08.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,As you know, a gentic AI is just a digital robot.\N如你所知，代理式 AI 就是一个数字机器人。
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.76,1:37:15.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It understands, it reasons, it plans, and it acts and uses tools.\N它能理解、推理、规划，并采取行动，还能使用工具。
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.76,1:37:20.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,A gentic AI is going to run across all of these computers.\N代理式 AI 将运行在所有这些计算机上。
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.44,1:37:24.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you've seen me talk about each and every one of these over time.\N你已经看到我过去多次谈到其中每一个。
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.16,1:37:28.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're working on humanoid robotics computers, robotics computers of all kinds.\N我们正在开发人形机器人计算机，以及各种类型的机器人计算机。
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.26,1:37:30.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're working on self-driving car computers.\N我们正在开发自动驾驶汽车计算机。
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.94,1:37:33.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're working on satellites.\N我们正在开发卫星计算机。
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.64,1:37:35.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have GeForce, which is has tensor cores.\N你有 GeForce，它配备了张量核心。
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.95,1:37:39.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just talked about a whole new line of PCs.\N我刚才谈到了一整系列全新的个人电脑。
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.24,1:37:45.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agriculture equipment, manufacturing equipment, heavy industry equipment will all be a gentic.\N农业设备、制造设备、重工业设备都将具备代理式功能。
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.48,1:37:50.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,You'll even have a little agentic helper for yourself.\N你甚至会拥有一个属于自己的小型代理式助手。
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.44,1:37:56.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even your base stations, the radio stations of the future are going to be agentic.\N就连你的基站，未来无线电台，也将具备代理式功能。
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.20,1:38:05.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understanding traffic and thinking about how to coordinate with the other base stations so that you could use as little energy as possible,\N理解交通状况，并思考如何与其他基站协调，以尽可能减少能耗，
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.58,1:38:10.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,increase the utilization, the efficiency of the spectral efficiency.\N提高利用率，提升频谱效率。
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.36,1:38:13.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, everything will run agents.\N因此，所有事物都将运行智能体。
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.20,1:38:16.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, Nvidia is largely in the center.\N如今，英伟达主要处于中心位置。
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.52,1:38:25.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I am pretty certain that there will be tens of billions, hundreds of billions over time of agentic systems,\N但我相当确定，随着时间推移，将会有数十亿、数百亿的代理式系统，
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.14,1:38:28.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,agentic computers that are going to be running around the world.\N代理式计算机将在全球范围内运行。
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.74,1:38:31.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,The biggest problem is data.\N最大的问题在于数据。
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.04,1:38:39.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the case of language models, all the English and all the language that we have on the internet that we trained on was from the perspective of us.\N以语言模型为例，我们在互联网上训练所用的所有英文及其他语言数据，都是从我们自身的视角出发的。
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.04,1:38:42.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,We wrote it and we're reading it.\N我们编写了它，也在阅读它。
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.48,1:38:51.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,However, in order to create a data for AI, robotics, it has to be in the perception, the perspective of the robot.\N然而，为了创建用于人工智能和机器人技术的数据，这些数据必须从机器人的感知角度出发。
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.96,1:38:57.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And most of the world's video data is from a third person, not first person.\N世界上绝大多数视频数据都是第三人称视角，而非第一人称视角。
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.68,1:39:05.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, agentic systems, robotic systems, physical AI, the data is the hardest problem.\N因此，对于代理式系统、机器人系统以及物理 AI 来说，数据是最难解决的问题。
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.92,1:39:08.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,You've seen us move up this ladder.\N你们已经看到我们沿着这条路径不断前进。
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.25,1:39:12.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,We started with teleoperations, which is basically human demonstration.\N我们从遥操作起步，本质上就是人类示范。
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.64,1:39:18.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is no different than the big breakthrough of reinforcement learning human feedback.\N这与强化学习中人类反馈带来的重大突破并无不同。
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.28,1:39:19.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,This then we use simulation.\N接着我们使用仿真。
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.04,1:39:21.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is where Omniverse comes in.\N这就是 Omniverse 的用武之地。
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.01,1:39:26.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is no different than reinforcement learning ver- verifiable rewards.\N这与强化学习中可验证的奖励机制没有区别。
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.01,1:39:27.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?\N明白了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.57,1:39:35.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, we use these systems to bootstrap the AI model, the physical AI model.\N因此，我们利用这些系统来启动 AI 模型，也就是物理 AI 模型。
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.80,1:39:40.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Eventually, we're able to learn from third per- third person,\N最终，我们能够从第三人称视角进行学习，
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.48,1:39:47.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,reprojecting it into first and now eventually through bootstrapping we have a world\N将其重新投影到第一人称视角，如今通过自举法，我们已构建出一个世界
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.41,1:39:53.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,foundation model that can understand the physical world from any perspective you want.\N基础模型，它能从任何你想要的视角理解物理世界。
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.51,1:39:58.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Third third-person, first-person, outside in, inside out, doesn't matter.\N第三人称、第一人称、由外向内、由内向外，都无关紧要。
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.52,1:40:07.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a big breakthrough indeed and today we are announcing Cosmos 3.\N这确实是一次重大突破，今天我们将正式发布 Cosmos 3。
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.44,1:40:13.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cosmos 3 is the frontier of physical AI.\NCosmos 3 是物理 AI 的前沿。
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.24,1:40:15.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are at the frontier with language models.\N我们正处于语言模型的前沿。
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.89,1:40:17.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's so many people working on it.\N如此多的人正在为此努力。
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.95,1:40:22.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,However, in physical AI, we are absolutely the world's best.\N然而，在物理 AI 领域，我们绝对是全球最顶尖的。
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.63,1:40:24.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am so proud of the team for doing this.\N我为团队所取得的成就感到无比自豪。
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.72,1:40:28.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the foundation model for all of your work.\N这是你们所有工作的基础模型。
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.40,1:40:34.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whenever you want to create a robot, whenever you want to create a factory robot or a robot that works in a factory,\N无论你何时想制造一台机器人，无论你想制造工厂机器人，或是在工厂中工作的机器人，
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.60,1:40:45.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,any kind of robot there in that involves physical world, you now have a companion, a Cosmos 3 that can understand and reason.\N任何涉及物理世界的机器人，现在你都有一个伙伴，一个能理解并推理的 Cosmos 3。
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.52,1:40:47.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,It can generate.\N它可以生成。
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.20,1:40:49.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,It can simulate in the loop.\N它可以在闭环中进行模拟。
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.07,1:40:51.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,It can even be the policy itself.\N它甚至可以成为策略本身。
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.42,1:40:54.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is on the top of leaderboards all over the all over the world.\N它在全球各类排行榜上均位居榜首。
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.00,1:40:58.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am incredibly proud of Cosmos and today we're announcing Cosmos 3.\N我对 Cosmos 深感自豪，今天我们将正式发布 Cosmos 3。
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.97,1:41:01.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.\N让我们来看一看。
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.84,1:41:05.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,The real world is infinite and unpredictable.\N现实世界是无限且不可预测的。
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.32,1:41:10.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Physical AI needs data, but real-world data is impossible to scale.\N物理 AI 需要数据，但现实世界的数据无法实现规模化。
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.88,1:41:14.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,For physical AI, compute is data.\N对于物理 AI 来说，计算即数据。
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.68,1:41:23.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Cosmos, an open frontier omnimodel for physical AI built on a new mixture of transformers architecture.\N这是 Cosmos，一个基于全新混合 Transformer \N架构构建的物理 AI 开放前沿全能模型。
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.12,1:41:29.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pixels, action, sound and language flow into the autoregressive transformer which reasons,\N像素、动作、声音和语言流入自回归 Transformer，它能够进行推理，
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.26,1:41:35.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,plans and instructs the diffusion transformer which generates what comes next.\N规划并指导扩散变换器生成接下来的内容。
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.16,1:41:39.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Developers post-train Cosmos across embodiments and use cases.\N开发者在多种具身形态和应用场景中对宇宙模型进行后训练。
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.64,1:41:49.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,As a VLM, Cosmos watches the physical world, understands what's happening, describing scenes, and flagging what matters.\N作为视觉-语言-动作模型，宇宙模型观察物理世界，理解正在发生的事，描述场景，并标记重要信息。
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.04,1:41:58.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,As a world model, Cosmos generates physics-accurate synthetic video from an image, text, or video.\N作为世界模型，宇宙模型能从一张图像、一段文字或一段视频生成物理上准确的合成视频。
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.56,1:42:03.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,As a simulator, Cosmos closes the loop for policy training and evaluation.\N作为模拟器，宇宙模型为策略训练和评估实现闭环。
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.84,1:42:13.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And as the foundation of NVIDIA Omniverse, an action-conditioned world model, Cosmos predicts the future frame by frame.\N作为英伟达 Omniverse 的基础，一种动作条件化的世界模型，宇宙模型逐帧预测未来。
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.40,1:42:17.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Post-train Cosmos, and it becomes a world action model.\N对宇宙模型进行后训练后，它便成为一种世界动作模型。
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.72,1:42:20.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Perceiving, reasoning, planning,\N感知、推理、规划，
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.64,1:42:30.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,generating actions for robots of every kind, for everything that moves.\N为各类机器人、所有移动物体生成动作。
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.44,1:42:37.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,A new kind of data, a new kind of teacher, generated by compute.\N一种新型数据，一种新型教师，由计算生成。
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.84,1:42:38.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cosmos,\N宇宙模型，
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.50,1:42:45.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,the foundation for developers of\N开发者的基石。
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.66,1:42:55.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,the age of physical AI.\N物理 AI 的时代。
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.24,1:43:00.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This takes data plus compute gives you AI.\N这需要数据加上计算，才能得到 AI。
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.48,1:43:04.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that we have AI, compute is data.\N现在我们有了 AI，计算就是数据。
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.96,1:43:08.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, use Cosmos 3, train a whole bunch of AI models.\N所以，使用 Cosmos 3，训练大量 AI 模型。
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.62,1:43:10.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cosmos is such an incredible open model system.\NCosmos 是一个令人难以置信的开放模型系统。
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.90,1:43:12.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's exactly the same as Nemotron.\N它与 Nemotron 完全相同。
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.57,1:43:13.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,We open model.\N我们开放模型。
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.48,1:43:22.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,We open the data, and we even open how we trained it so that you could enhance it for yourself and turn Cosmos into your proprietary model.\N我们开放数据，甚至开放训练方式，让你可以自行优化，将 Cosmos 转化为你的专有模型。
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.97,1:43:27.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have such incredible partners working with us in so many different industries.\N我们拥有众多令人惊叹的合作伙伴，在众多不同行业中与我们协作。
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.40,1:43:36.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, the model itself is the most, of course, the most understandable part of the AI stack, but the AI stack is very complicated.\N模型本身当然是 AI 架构中最容易理解的部分，但 AI 架构非常复杂。
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.34,1:43:43.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has generators, the model, simulators, and the runtime.\N它包含生成器、模型、模拟器和运行时。
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.12,1:43:45.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just as Just as it is for agentic systems,\N正如代理式系统一样，
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.98,1:43:56.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,these cars are essentially a physical AI agentic robot that is a is a autonomous vehicle has also this complicated stack.\N这些汽车本质上是一种物理 AI 代理式机器人，同时也是一个自动驾驶车辆，还搭载了复杂的软件栈。
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.88,1:44:03.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, we're announcing Alpamayo 2, an open model for self-driving cars.\N今天，我们宣布推出 Alpamayo 2，这是一个面向自动驾驶汽车的开源模型。
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.04,1:44:07.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're working with car companies across the world.\N我们正在与全球各地的汽车公司合作。
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.20,1:44:10.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you look at these brands that have signed up for the NVIDIA Hyperion,\N如果你看看这些已经加入英伟达 Hyperion 计划的品牌，
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.88,1:44:19.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,that are building NVIDIA Hyperion cars, this represents about 80% of the world's cars.\N那些正在开发英伟达 Hyperion 车型的厂商，它们代表了全球约 80% 的汽车。
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.51,1:44:23.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,The manufacturers represent 80% of the world's cars.\N这些制造商覆盖了全球约 80% 的汽车市场。
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.09,1:44:31.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are going to have a whole lot of NVIDIA Hyperion systems that are able to run Alpamayo or anybody else's AV stack.\N我们将拥有大量能够运行 Alpamayo 或其他任何自动驾驶软件栈的英伟达 Hyperion 系统。
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.00,1:44:34.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are also connected into mobility services.\N我们还接入了出行服务生态。
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.97,1:44:40.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Approximately 97% of the world's mobility services are connecting with us so that\N全球约 97% 的出行服务正在与我们连接，因此
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.64,1:44:47.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,when we deploy Alpamayo on the Hyperion runtime with the Halos operating system,\N当我们在 Hyperion 运行时环境与 Halos 操作系统上部署 Alpamayo 时，
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.04,1:44:51.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will be able to connect to all of these services across the world.\N我们将能够连接到全球各地的这些服务。
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.98,1:44:55.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look at this.\N让我们来看一下。
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.68,1:44:59.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hey Mercedes, let's go to my favorite sandwich shop.\N嘿，梅赛德斯，我们去我最喜欢的三明治店吧。
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.76,1:45:03.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Routing to your destination.\N正在导航至目的地。
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.28,1:45:03.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lane is clear.\N车道畅通。
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.00,1:45:05.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pulling out to start drive.\N出发行驶。
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.48,1:45:09.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nudge left due to the stationary lead vehicle ahead blocking our lane.\N由于前方静止的前车挡住了我们的车道，向左微调。
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.00,1:45:13.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Slow down to stop at the stop sign controlling the intersection.\N减速并在路口的停车标志前停下。
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.76,1:45:17.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop to yield to the pedestrian since the person is in our lane.\N停下让行，因为行人正在我们的车道上。
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.84,1:45:19.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yield to the cut-in vehicle from the left.\N让行左侧切入的车辆。
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.71,1:45:22.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nudge left to clear the stopped vehicle blocking on the right.\N向左微调以避开右侧停着的车辆。
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.68,1:45:25.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Keep distance to the cut-in vehicle since it is merging into our lane.\N与切入车辆保持距离，因为它正要并入我们的车道。
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.86,1:45:28.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nudge left due to the stopped van blocking the right side of our lane.\N由于右侧车道被停着的厢式货车挡住，向左微调。
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.72,1:45:30.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nudge right due to crossing ahead.\N由于前方有交叉路口，向右微调。
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.58,1:45:33.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop to keep distance to the lead vehicle directly ahead in our lane.\N停车以保持与前方同车道车辆的安全距离。
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.68,1:45:35.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Keep distance to the vehicle directly ahead in our lane.\N保持与前方同车道车辆的安全距离。
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.39,1:45:37.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop for the stop signs if the intersection is controlled by a stop sign.\N若路口由停车标志控制，遇到停车标志时请停车。
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.70,1:45:39.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yield to cross traffic since the vehicle is crossing ahead.\N由于前方有车辆正在横穿，需让行交叉方向车流。
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.63,1:45:40.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Keep distance to the lead vehicle.\N保持与前车的安全距离。
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.75,1:45:42.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nudge left due to the truck blocking the right side of our lane.\N由于卡车挡住了车道右侧，向左微调。
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.10,1:45:43.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nudge right due to the truck blocking the left side of our lane.\N由于卡车挡住了车道左侧，向右微调。
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.80,1:45:46.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nudge left due to the truck blocking the left side of our lane.\N由于卡车挡住了车道左侧，向左微调。
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.73,1:45:57.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Keep distance Your destination is on the right.\N保持距离，目的地在右侧。
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.12,1:46:00.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Open my eyes.\N打开我的眼睛。
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.24,1:46:05.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The world's first reasoning autonomous vehicle.\N世界首款具备推理能力的自动驾驶汽车。
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.40,1:46:10.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you let it talk all the time, it will drive you crazy.\N如果让它一直说个不停，你会疯掉的。
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.28,1:46:15.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, we're very happy that it's talking to itself all the time.\N但我们非常高兴它一直在自言自语。
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.60,1:46:17.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's called thinking.\N这就叫思考。
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.08,1:46:18.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, Open my eyes is a reasoning car.\N因此，“打开我的眼睛”是一款具备推理能力的汽车。
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.04,1:46:23.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The technology that we've created also applies to humanoids.\N我们所创造的技术同样适用于人形机器人。
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.28,1:46:26.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course, there many new breakthroughs that has to happen.\N当然，还有很多新的突破需要实现。
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.46,1:46:31.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The NVIDIA Isaac GR00T is our humanoid robotic stack.\N英伟达 Isaac GR00T 是我们的人形机器人软件栈。
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.40,1:46:42.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,model data generation simulation the runs the run time including the operating system.\N模型数据生成、仿真、运行时，包括操作系统。
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.39,1:46:48.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,This represents GR00T platform, the Isaac GR00T platform.\N这代表了 GR00T 平台，即 Isaac GR00T 平台。
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.60,1:46:54.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every one of our systems, as you can see, the exact same pattern, whether it's agentic system for the cloud,\N从你看到的每个系统来看，都遵循完全相同的模式，无论是用于云的代理式系统，
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.80,1:47:03.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,agentic system for the PC, a robotic system for a self-driving car, a robotic system for a humanoid robot, all the same.\N用于 PC 的代理式系统，用于自动驾驶汽车的机器人系统，还是用于人形机器人的机器人系统，全都一样。
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.36,1:47:10.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,And of course, in every single case, we build everything completely.\N当然，在每种情况下，我们都完全自主地构建一切。
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.48,1:47:16.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,We build everything vertically, completely integrated with co-design,\N我们完全垂直整合地构建一切，采用协同设计。
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.80,1:47:22.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,extreme co-design, and then we open it up for everybody to use whichever part you like.\N极致的协同设计，然后我们将其开放给所有人使用，你可以自由选择其中任意部分。
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.52,1:47:26.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,And whatever you want to use, we even help you modify.\N无论你想使用什么，我们甚至会帮你进行修改。
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.76,1:47:33.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the one thing that is missing is we need a reference platform for robotic systems.\N但目前缺少的是，我们需要一个机器人系统的参考平台。
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.24,1:47:38.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,These robotic systems are so complicated, so many motors, so many sensors, so fragile.\N这些机器人系统非常复杂，拥有大量电机和传感器，且十分脆弱。
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.64,1:47:48.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And yet we need to have a way to deliver these reference platforms just like we do with PCs and DGXs and clouds and self-driving cars,\N然而我们仍需要一种方式，像提供个人电脑、DGX 和云服务以及自动驾驶汽车那样，交付这些参考平台。
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.97,1:47:51.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,we now are going to do it for robots.\N现在，我们将为机器人实现这一点。
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.05,1:47:57.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today we're announcing the NVIDIA Isaac GR00T, a reference humanoid robot, all fully integrated.\N今天，我们宣布推出英伟达 Isaac GR00T，一款完全集成的参考人形机器人。
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.02,1:48:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,25 degrees of freedom on the on each hand made by Sharpa.\N每只手拥有 25 个自由度，由 Sharpa 制造。
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.96,1:48:05.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,31 degrees of freedom on the robot.\N机器人整体拥有 31 个自由度。
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.99,1:48:08.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,6 ft, 150 lbs.\N身高 6 英尺，重 150 磅。
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.68,1:48:14.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just like me.\N就像我一样。
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.16,1:48:18.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first number is shorter, the second number is bigger.\N第一个数字更短，第二个数字更大。
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.60,1:48:20.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, pretty close.\N否则，非常接近了。
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.56,1:48:25.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and this platform runs the new Thor and our entire software stack.\N这个平台运行着新的 Thor 以及我们完整的软件栈。
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.92,1:48:35.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Data generation stack, data simulation stack, the runtime, all integrated into a robot that is designed for everyone to use.\N数据生成栈、数据仿真栈、运行时环境，全部集成到一台专为人人使用而设计的机器人中。
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.34,1:48:43.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, we built this for higher education and university researchers because for them to build this is insanely hard to do.\N我们为高等教育和大学研究人员打造了这个系统，因为对他们来说，自行构建这样的系统极其困难。
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.25,1:48:46.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so let's take a look at that.\N那么，让我们来看看这一点。
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.32,1:48:50.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,The next leap in AI is general purpose robots, humanoids.\NAI 下一个飞跃是通用机器人，也就是人形机器人。
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.26,1:48:51.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,But building one is hard.\N但要打造一台人形机器人很难。
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.98,1:49:00.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every team starts from scratch, stitching together simulators, teleop systems, data pipelines, and training infrastructure.\N每个团队都得从零开始，拼接仿真器、遥操作系统、数据管道和训练基础设施。
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.26,1:49:03.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Months of setup before research can start.\N在研究开始前，光是搭建环境就要花上数月。
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.32,1:49:08.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA Isaac GR00T, an open development platform for humanoid robots.\N英伟达 Isaac GR00T，一个面向人形机器人的开源开发平台。
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.80,1:49:14.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Open models, simulation and training libraries, and data generators.\N开源模型、仿真与训练库，以及数据生成工具。
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.16,1:49:16.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Plus the robot computer.\N还有机器人计算机。
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.92,1:49:19.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fully pipe clean, ready to go in hours.\N完全管道清洁，数小时内即可投入使用。
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.92,1:49:26.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,First, set up the simulation environment in Isaac Lab.\N首先在 Isaac Lab 中设置仿真环境。
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.80,1:49:34.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Capture demonstrations with Isaac Teleop on a real or simulated robot.\N使用 Isaac Teleop 在真实或仿真机器人上采集示范数据。
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.24,1:49:41.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Generate synthetic data with Omniverse and Cosmos, scaling one demonstration into thousands.\N通过 Omniverse 和 Cosmos 生成合成数据，将一次示范扩展为数千次。
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.04,1:49:48.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Train policies, evaluate them in Isaac Lab Arena.\N在 Isaac Lab Arena 中训练策略并进行评估。
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.88,1:49:50.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Deploy through Isaac ROS,\N通过 Isaac ROS 部署，
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.60,1:49:51.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,running on\N运行在
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.32,1:49:57.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jetson\NJetson
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.91,1:50:03.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thor.\NThor 上。
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.56,1:50:06.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every element modular, open.\N每个组件均模块化且开放。
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.50,1:50:10.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Use ours or swap in your own.\N可使用我们的，也可替换为自己的。
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.80,1:50:19.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,GR00T is powering robotics research across every discipline, for every domain, from research labs to factory floors.\NGR00T 正在推动各个学科、各个领域的机器人研究，从实验室到工厂车间。
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.00,1:50:27.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,One open platform.\N一个开放平台。
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.72,1:50:30.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now, a new addition.\N现在，新增一项功能。
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.28,1:50:33.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Isaac GR00T reference design robots.\NIsaac GR00T 参考设计机器人。
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.28,1:50:40.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Built on Nvidia's open platform, ready for frontier research for any lab, anywhere.\N基于英伟达的开放平台，随时可为全球任何实验室的前沿研究提供支持。
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.36,1:50:42.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The age of robotics starts here.\N机器人时代由此开启。
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.92,1:50:48.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia Isaac GR00T.\N英伟达 Isaac GR00T。
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.56,1:50:55.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,So many robots.\N如此多的机器人。
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.00,1:51:01.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're working with just about everybody who's working on robots in the world or robotic systems in the world.\N我们正与全球几乎所有从事机器人或机器人系统研发的机构合作。
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.32,1:51:03.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you what I told you.\N让我告诉你我之前告诉过你的事。
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.60,1:51:07.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The computer industry has been completely changed.\N计算机行业已彻底改变。
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.40,1:51:10.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the last 6 months, everything changed.\N在过去六个月里，一切发生了变化。
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.72,1:51:22.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything changed because agents were realized and it converged with the latest frontier models and it made possible the AI to now do useful work.\N一切改变是因为智能体被实现，它与最新的前沿模型融合，使得 AI 现在能够完成真正有用的工作。
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.40,1:51:26.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,The computing pattern will repeat over and over and over again.\N这种计算模式将不断重复、重复、再重复。
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.52,1:51:35.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,This computing pattern of an agent that's a model, a harness that uses tools with skills and runs in a runtime.\N这种由模型构成的智能体，搭配使用工具与技能的运行框架，并在运行时环境中执行的计算模式。
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.20,1:51:40.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,That runtime depends on whether it's in the cloud or on prem, on a PC or a robot.\N这个运行时环境取决于它是在云端，还是在本地，是在个人电脑上，还是在机器人上。
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.18,1:51:44.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the computing pattern is exactly the same for all of them.\N但所有这些场景下的计算模式完全相同。
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.92,1:51:47.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,You will use different harnesses because of your preference.\N你会因为个人偏好而使用不同的运行框架。
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.42,1:51:49.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,You will use different models because of your preference.\N你会因为个人偏好而使用不同的模型。
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.98,1:51:52.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,You will improve them for your proprietary use.\N你会针对自己的专有用途对它们进行优化。
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.86,1:51:58.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,You would create sub super agents that you can rent to other people to help them do their work.\N你可以创建子级超级智能体，出租给其他人，帮助他们完成工作。
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.88,1:52:05.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This agentic platform, this agentic pattern Nvidia has an enterprise AI toolkit.\N这个代理式平台，这种代理式模式，正是英伟达提供的企业AI工具包。
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.48,1:52:12.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a wonderful way for all of you to engage your AIs and for us it's a wonderful growth opportunity.\N这是你们所有人与AI互动的绝佳方式，对我们而言，这也是一个绝佳的增长机遇。
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.00,1:52:16.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin is in full production.\N维拉·鲁宾已全面投入生产。
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.12,1:52:22.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whereas Grace Blackwell was created to process AI, particularly inference.\N而格蕾丝·布莱克威尔则是为处理AI，特别是推理任务而设计的。
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.60,1:52:25.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin was created to run agents.\N薇拉·鲁宾的创建目的是运行智能体。
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.01,1:52:27.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is in full production.\N已全面投入生产。
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.51,1:52:29.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is much much more than a GPU.\N它远不止是一块GPU。
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.81,1:52:35.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is entire disaggregated, distributed agent processing system.\N这是一个完全解耦、分布式的智能体处理系统。
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.88,1:52:39.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia has really become an infrastructure company.\N英伟达已真正成为一家基础设施公司。
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.20,1:52:46.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not just a GPU company, not just a systems company, but an infrastructure company to help you generate the maximum revenues,\N不仅是GPU公司，不仅是系统公司，更是一家基础设施公司，助你实现最大收益。
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.66,1:52:50.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,the maximum profit and to get there as soon as possible.\N最大利润，并尽快达成目标。
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.00,1:52:59.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The agent world this new way of doing computing where you build CPUs now for agents, not for people.\N智能体时代，这是一种全新的计算方式，我们现在为智能体而非人类设计CPU。
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.48,1:53:05.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,CPUs for agents has its own special requirement and our Nvidia Vera is revolutionary.\N智能体专用的 CPU 有其独特需求，而我们的英伟达 Vera 是革命性的。
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.68,1:53:08.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy about its RAM.\N我太高兴它的内存了。
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.20,1:53:15.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The order is already is going to make it the fastest and the most successful product launch in our company's history.\N这一订单将使它成为公司历史上最快、最成功的产品发布。
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.64,1:53:19.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia and Microsoft has created a whole new line of PCs.\N英伟达和微软共同打造了一整条全新的电脑产品线。
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.08,1:53:20.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a new beginning.\N这是一个全新的开始。
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.80,1:53:25.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,And of course, that exact same agentic pattern that I agentic processing pattern,\N当然，我刚才描述的这种代理式处理模式，
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.82,1:53:31.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,computing pattern that I just described is also going to run on all kinds of devices.\N这种计算模式也将在各种设备上运行。
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.94,1:53:42.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mentioned PCs, but in the future, it'll be robots and satellites and base stations and factories, in the cloud, on prem, at the edge.\N我提到了个人电脑，但未来它还将运行在机器人、卫星、基站、工厂、云端、本地部署以及边缘设备上。
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.07,1:53:50.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,This pattern, agentic AI system, this agentic computing pattern will be replicated in computers all over.\N这种代理式 AI 系统，这种代理式计算模式，将在全球各地的计算机中被复制。
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.11,1:53:54.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,How we think about the personal computer will very likely change.\N我们对个人电脑的认知很可能会发生改变。
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.52,1:53:58.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to thank all of you for your partnership, your friendship.\N我想感谢大家一直以来的合作与友谊。
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.58,1:54:01.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,We couldn't be here without everything that we do together.\N没有我们共同的努力，我们不可能走到今天。
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.69,1:54:05.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am so proud of how you've been so successful this last year.\N我为你们在过去一年取得的巨大成功感到无比自豪。
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.88,1:54:09.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,The next year is going to be even more.\N明年将会更加精彩。
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.17,1:54:09.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have one\N我还有一件事
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.84,1:54:21.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,more thing for you.\N要告诉你们。
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.27,1:54:32.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.\N我们来看一下。
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.12,1:54:36.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,You ready, Taiwan?\N台湾准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.32,1:54:37.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.\N开始吧。
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.92,1:54:40.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The keynote's coming at Computex.\N主题演讲将在 Computex 上举行。
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.64,1:54:42.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jensen showed the world what's next.\N黄仁勋向世界展示了未来。
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.76,1:54:44.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Useful AI has arrived.\N实用的 AI 已经到来。
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.00,1:54:47.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agents working by your side.\N智能体在你身边工作。
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.39,1:54:52.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,But in case you missed things we said today, we're going to break it all down for you, Taipei.\N但如果你错过了我们今天说的内容，我们将在台北为你一一解析。
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.00,1:54:55.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agents used to be misunderstood.\N智能体过去常被误解。
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.12,1:54:57.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only movie stars had them in Hollywood.\N只有好莱坞的电影明星才有它们。
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.52,1:55:02.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now we all got teams making dreams come true, building companies from living rooms.\N现在我们每个人都有团队，让梦想成真，从客厅里创办公司。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.58,1:55:04.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,But they need so much compute.\N但它们需要大量的计算能力。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.54,1:55:05.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,We hear you.\N我们听到了。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.60,1:55:07.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's why we created Vera.\N这就是为什么我们创造了维拉。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.80,1:55:09.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rubin's law, the show is true.\N鲁宾定律，这节目是真的。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.68,1:55:12.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cheapest tokens coming through.\N最便宜的词元正在通过。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.24,1:55:14.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,10 times faster inference heaven.\N推理速度提升十倍，简直是天堂。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.33,1:55:17.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,More special agents than 007.\N特工数量比007还多。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.28,1:55:19.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,BlueField keeps agents memory true.\N蓝场保持特工记忆的准确性。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.96,1:55:22.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, let's talk about it, CPU.\N现在，我们来谈谈它，CPU。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.28,1:55:24.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,50% faster, that's outrageous.\N快了50%，这太离谱了。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.48,1:55:25.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not for Vera.\N这不是为维拉准备的。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.48,1:55:26.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's built for agents.\N它专为智能体而生。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.88,1:55:29.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVLink Fusion blends ASICs smartly.\NNVLink融合智能地整合了ASIC。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.30,1:55:32.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyone's welcome to the NVLink party.\N欢迎所有人参加 NVLink 派对。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.32,1:55:34.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, if you like that introduction.\N嗯，如果你喜欢这个开场。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.80,1:55:35.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zero Rubins.\N一个 Rubin 都没有。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.92,1:55:37.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,In full production.\N已全面投入生产。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.44,1:55:39.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nemotron 3 Ultra leave the run.\NNemotron 3 Ultra 开始运行。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.00,1:55:41.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Five x faster work gets done.\N五倍快的工作效率得以实现。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.02,1:55:44.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,NeMo Guardrails keeps the guardrails right.\NNeMo 护栏确保护栏始终到位。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.51,1:55:47.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,OpenShell keeps the sandbox tight.\NOpenShell 保持沙箱严密。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.12,1:55:49.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your code migrated and reviewed.\N你的代码已完成迁移并经过审查。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.76,1:55:52.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,All before this song is through.\N在这首歌结束前全部完成。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.72,1:55:56.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI is a five layer cake for revenue.\NAI 是收入的五层蛋糕。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.30,1:55:57.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Make no mistake.\N千万别搞错。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.56,1:55:59.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Global AI clouds with lots of gigawatts.\N拥有大量吉瓦电力的全球AI云。
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.78,1:56:02.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Giga next keeps power lean, connecting dots.\NGiga Next 保持电力精简，连接各个节点。
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.52,1:56:04.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every watt optimized for you.\N每瓦电力都为你优化。
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.40,1:56:05.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you can have your cake.\N于是你既能拥有蛋糕。
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.84,1:56:07.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And eat it, too.\N又能吃掉它。
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.84,1:56:09.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,RTX marks the year.\NRTX 标志着这一年的到来。
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.80,1:56:12.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Biggest PC moment in 40 years.\N40年来最大的PC时刻。
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.52,1:56:14.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agents powering our workflows.\N智能体正在驱动我们的工作流程。
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.00,1:56:16.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Running anywhere Windows goes.\N只要Windows能到的地方，它就能运行。
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.80,1:56:19.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Harnesses run on CPU.\N运行框架在CPU上运行。
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.36,1:56:21.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Models fly on GPU.\N模型在GPU上飞速运行。
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.80,1:56:24.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cosmos build worlds that robots need.\NCosmos 构建机器人所需的世界。
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.28,1:56:26.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Turning computing into synthetic feet.\N将计算转化为合成的足部动作。
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.68,1:56:29.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alpamayo reasons through.\N阿尔帕马约通过推理来思考。
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.28,1:56:31.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understand flows like people do.\N理解流动，如同人类一样。
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.76,1:56:34.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who is how they learn to move.\N他们如何学习移动，就决定了他们是谁。
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.32,1:56:36.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Learning skills and finding groove.\N学习技能，找到节奏。
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.68,1:56:39.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,You'll need trees powered by those.\N你需要由这些驱动的树。
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.40,1:56:41.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's still just humanoid.\N它仍然只是人形机器人。
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.84,1:56:50.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come\N来
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.86,1:56:58.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,on.\N吧。
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.08,1:57:06.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come\N来
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.32,1:57:12.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,on.\N吧。
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.92,1:57:14.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,The future's bright.\N未来一片光明。
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.99,1:57:19.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come see what's next.\N来看看接下来的精彩内容。
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.44,1:57:21.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Taiwan.\N感谢台湾。
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.00,1:57:32.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Computex.\N欢迎莅临 Computex。
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.96,1:57:36.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dàjiā xièxie.\N大家谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.28,1:57:37.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,HAVE A GREAT COMPUTEX.\N祝大家拥有一个精彩的 Computex。
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.65,1:57:38.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dàjiā xièxie.\N大家谢谢。
